1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,777
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? GENKI ning N5 grammatikasi

2
00:00:08,777 --> 00:00:10,277
1-Sahna: Tanishtirish va millati / Oʻzini tanishtirish va millat

3
00:00:10,277 --> 00:00:15,149
Tanishganimdan xursandman, men Tanaka

4
00:00:15,173 --> 00:00:18,852
Tanishganimdan xursandman, men Smit

5
00:00:18,875 --> 00:00:22,908
Smit-san, siz amerikalikmisiz?

6
00:00:22,931 --> 00:00:27,734
Ha, men amerikalikman

7
00:00:27,758 --> 00:00:30,958
Tanaka-san, siz yaponmisiz?

8
00:00:30,981 --> 00:00:36,066
Ha, men yaponman

9
00:00:36,089 --> 00:00:40,064
Men yapon tili oʻqituvchisiman

10
00:00:40,088 --> 00:00:42,889
Universitet oʻqituvchisiman

11
00:00:42,912 --> 00:00:45,246
Shundaymi?

12
00:00:45,269 --> 00:00:48,877
Men talabaman

13
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:52,579
Smit-san, qaysi universitetning talabasiz?

14
00:00:52,603 --> 00:00:57,075
Men Sakura universitetining talabaman

15
00:00:57,098 --> 00:01:00,371
Sakura universitetining talabamisiz?

16
00:01:00,395 --> 00:01:02,861
Mutaxassisligingiz nima?

17
00:01:02,884 --> 00:01:06,918
Mening mutaxassisligim biznes

18
00:01:06,941 --> 00:01:10,674
Tanaka-san, sizning mutaxassisligingiz nima?

19
00:01:10,697 --> 00:01:15,330
Mening mutaxassisligim Yaponiyaning tarixi

20
00:01:15,353 --> 00:01:18,602
Yaponiyaning tariximi?

21
00:01:18,625 --> 00:01:21,625
U kishi talabami?

22
00:01:21,648 --> 00:01:26,222
Yoʻq, u kishi talaba emas

23
00:01:26,245 --> 00:01:30,412
U kishi ingliz tili oʻqituvchisi

24
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:32,435
Shundaymi?

25
00:01:32,458 --> 00:01:35,391
Ismingiz nima?

26
00:01:35,414 --> 00:01:38,181
Ismim Jon

27
00:01:38,204 --> 00:01:40,771
Men inglizman

28
00:01:40,794 --> 00:01:45,068
Jon-san, Sakura universitetining oʻqituvchimisiz?

29
00:01:45,091 --> 00:01:50,291
Ha, Sakura universitetining oʻqituvchisiman

30
00:01:50,314 --> 00:01:53,081
Mening doʻstim

31
00:01:53,104 --> 00:01:56,437
Jon-san, sizning mutaxassisligingiz nima?

32
00:01:56,460 --> 00:02:01,660
Jon-sanning mutaxassisligi ingliz adabiyoti

33
00:02:01,683 --> 00:02:03,571
Shundaymi?

34
00:02:03,595 --> 00:02:07,795
Jon-san mening oʻqituvchim

35
00:02:07,818 --> 00:02:11,784
E, Smit-sanning oʻqituvchingizmi?

36
00:02:11,807 --> 00:02:16,641
Ha, mening ingliz tili oʻqituvchim

37
00:02:16,664 --> 00:02:19,464
Tom-san ham talabami?

38
00:02:19,487 --> 00:02:24,120
Yoʻq, Tom-san talaba emas

39
00:02:24,143 --> 00:02:26,321
Ishchi

40
00:02:26,344 --> 00:02:29,478
Tom-san ham amerikalikmi?

41
00:02:29,501 --> 00:02:34,069
Ha, Tom-san ham amerikalik

42
00:02:34,093 --> 00:02:36,767
Mening doʻstim

43
00:02:36,790 --> 00:02:39,727
Maryam-san ham ishchimi?

44
00:02:39,751 --> 00:02:44,841
Yoʻq, Maryam-san ishchi emas

45
00:02:44,865 --> 00:02:46,940
Talaba

46
00:02:46,964 --> 00:02:50,539
Maryam-san ham inglizmi?

47
00:02:50,562 --> 00:02:55,162
Ha, Maryam-san ham ingliz

48
00:02:55,185 --> 00:03:04,194
Bugungi video skriptini tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentdan yuklab olish mumkin

49
00:03:04,194 --> 00:03:05,694
2-Sahna: Koʻrsatgichlar va narxlar / Koʻrsatgichlar va narxlar (Darsliklar va lugʻatlar)

50
00:03:05,694 --> 00:03:07,461
Kechirasiz

51
00:03:07,483 --> 00:03:09,933
Bu nima?

52
00:03:09,957 --> 00:03:11,724
Bu nima?

53
00:03:11,747 --> 00:03:15,714
Bu yapon tili darsligi

54
00:03:15,736 --> 00:03:18,795
Ushbu darslik qancha turadi?

55
00:03:18,819 --> 00:03:22,706
Bu darslik 3000 yena.

56
00:03:22,730 --> 00:03:26,175
Ana u ham yapon tili darsligi mi?

57
00:03:26,198 --> 00:03:31,238
Yoʻq, u yapon tili darsligi emas.

58
00:03:31,262 --> 00:03:33,901
Ingliz tili lugʻati.

59
00:03:33,925 --> 00:03:36,811
U lugʻat qancha turadi?

60
00:03:36,834 --> 00:03:40,306
Bu lugʻat 5000 yena.

61
00:03:40,330 --> 00:03:43,863
Qaysi lugʻat Smit-saniki?

62
00:03:43,886 --> 00:03:46,419
Bu lugʻat.

63
00:03:46,442 --> 00:03:49,609
U lugʻat Tanaka-saniki mi?

64
00:03:49,632 --> 00:03:54,165
Yoʻq, bu lugʻat mening emas.

65
00:03:54,188 --> 00:03:55,821
Tushunarli.

66
00:03:55,844 --> 00:03:58,502
Bu yer sinf xonasi mi?

67
00:03:58,526 --> 00:04:02,859
Ha, bu yer yapon tili sinf xonasi.

68
00:04:02,882 --> 00:04:05,358
U yer kutubxona.

69
00:04:05,382 --> 00:04:07,828
Ishxona qayerda?

70
00:04:07,851 --> 00:04:10,492
Ishxona ana u yerda.

71
00:04:10,516 --> 00:04:13,011
Qabulxona ham ana u yerda mi?

72
00:04:13,034 --> 00:04:16,468
Ha, qabulxona ham ana u yerda.

73
00:04:16,491 --> 00:04:18,962
Hojatxona qayerda?

74
00:04:18,986 --> 00:04:21,752
Hojatxona ana u yerda.

75
00:04:21,775 --> 00:04:24,388
Ana u bino oʻng tomonida.

76
00:04:24,412 --> 00:04:26,412
Qaysi bino?

77
00:04:26,435 --> 00:04:28,768
Ana u bino.

78
00:04:28,791 --> 00:04:30,359
Tushunarli.

79
00:04:30,383 --> 00:04:32,785
Bu ruchka mi?

80
00:04:32,809 --> 00:04:35,975
Ha, u ruchka.

81
00:04:35,998 --> 00:04:38,532
Bu ruchka qancha turadi?

82
00:04:38,555 --> 00:04:41,559
U ruchka 100 yen.

83
00:04:41,583 --> 00:04:43,986
Ana u 200 yen.

84
00:04:44,009 --> 00:04:47,061
Qaysi ruchka oʻqituvchining ruchkasi?

85
00:04:47,084 --> 00:04:50,151
Bu ruchka mening ruchkam.

86
00:04:50,175 --> 00:04:52,380
U ham 100 yenmi?

87
00:04:52,403 --> 00:04:56,221
Yoʻq, bu 3000 yen.

88
00:04:56,244 --> 00:05:03,349
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif qismida va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

89
00:05:03,349 --> 00:05:04,849
3-Sahna: Buyum egaligini aniqlash / Buyumlar egaligini aniqlash

90
00:05:04,849 --> 00:05:10,216
Smit-san, bu Smit-san soyaboni mi?

91
00:05:10,239 --> 00:05:15,689
Yoʻq, u mening soyabonim emas.

92
00:05:15,713 --> 00:05:19,852
Unda, bu kimning soyaboni?

93
00:05:19,875 --> 00:05:23,845
U Jon-sanning soyaboni.

94
00:05:23,868 --> 00:05:27,002
Jon-sanning soyaboni mi?

95
00:05:27,025 --> 00:05:30,358
Bu sumka ham Jon-sanningmi?

96
00:05:30,381 --> 00:05:36,996
Yoʻq, bu sumka Jon-sanning emas.

97
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:39,918
Jon-sanning emasmi?

98
00:05:39,942 --> 00:05:43,708
Unda, kimning sumkasi?

99
00:05:43,731 --> 00:05:47,265
U mening sumkam.

100
00:05:47,288 --> 00:05:50,721
Mening qimmatbaho sumkam.

101
00:05:50,744 --> 00:05:54,077
A, Smit-sanning sumkasi ekan.

102
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:57,639
Bu daftar ham Smit-sanningmi?

103
00:05:57,662 --> 00:06:02,431
Yoʻq, bu mening emas.

104
00:06:02,455 --> 00:06:05,423
Meri-sanniki.

105
00:06:05,446 --> 00:06:08,446
Bu Maryamning daftarimi?

106
00:06:08,469 --> 00:06:11,436
Maryam ham talabami?

107
00:06:11,459 --> 00:06:16,076
Ha, Maryam ham talaba.

108
00:06:16,099 --> 00:06:19,438
Sakura universitetining talabasi.

109
00:06:19,462 --> 00:06:23,112
Maryam ham amerikalikmi?

110
00:06:23,135 --> 00:06:28,535
Yo'q, Maryam amerikalik emas.

111
00:06:28,558 --> 00:06:31,175
U ingliz.

112
00:06:31,198 --> 00:06:36,565
Shundaymi? Jon ham ingliz ekan.

113
00:06:36,588 --> 00:06:40,669
Ha, Jon ham ingliz.

114
00:06:40,693 --> 00:06:44,102
Smit amerikalik ekan, shundaymi?

115
00:06:44,126 --> 00:06:47,728
Ha, men amerikalikman

116
00:06:47,752 --> 00:06:50,885
Tom ham amerikalik.

117
00:06:50,908 --> 00:06:54,163
Tom-san ham talabami?

118
00:06:54,186 --> 00:06:58,880
Yo'q, Tom talaba emas.

119
00:06:58,903 --> 00:07:00,880
U ishchi.

120
00:07:00,904 --> 00:07:04,637
Bu soat Tomning soatimi?

121
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:09,493
Yo'q, bu Tomning soati emas.

122
00:07:09,516 --> 00:07:11,250
Meningi.

123
00:07:11,273 --> 00:07:14,206
Bu Jonning soati emasmi?

124
00:07:14,229 --> 00:07:18,162
Ha, Jonning emas.

125
00:07:18,185 --> 00:07:20,478
Smitning soati ekan.

126
00:07:20,502 --> 00:07:23,835
Ha, meningi.

127
00:07:23,858 --> 00:07:25,358
4-SAHNA: KUNDALIK TURMUSH / Har kuni hayot tartibi

128
00:07:25,358 --> 00:07:31,792
Smit-san, siz har kuni soat nechada turasiz?

129
00:07:31,815 --> 00:07:35,681
Men har kuni soat 7 da turaman.

130
00:07:35,704 --> 00:07:38,371
Nonushta qilasizmi?

131
00:07:38,394 --> 00:07:39,794
Ha.

132
00:07:39,817 --> 00:07:43,050
Uyda non yeyman.

133
00:07:43,073 --> 00:07:45,707
Qahva ichaman.

134
00:07:45,730 --> 00:07:49,420
Keyin maktabga borasizmi?

135
00:07:49,443 --> 00:07:50,977
Ha.

136
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:54,213
Saat 8 da maktabga boraman.

137
00:07:54,236 --> 00:07:57,603
Maktabda nima qilasiz?

138
00:07:57,626 --> 00:08:01,659
Sinfdagi yapon tilini o'rganaman.

139
00:08:01,682 --> 00:08:06,615
Keyin kutubxonada kitob o'qiyman.

140
00:08:06,638 --> 00:08:09,605
Tushlikni qayerda yeyasiz?

141
00:08:09,629 --> 00:08:12,962
Kafeteriyada tushlik qilaman.

142
00:08:12,985 --> 00:08:16,278
Do'stlarim bilan ovqatlanaman.

143
00:08:16,301 --> 00:08:19,301
Siz uyga soat nechada qaytasiz?

144
00:08:19,324 --> 00:08:22,201
Saat 5 da uyga qaytaman.

145
00:08:22,225 --> 00:08:25,003
Kechqurun nima qilasiz?

146
00:08:25,026 --> 00:08:28,160
Uyda televizor ko'raman.

147
00:08:28,183 --> 00:08:30,316
Musiqa tinglayman.

148
00:08:30,339 --> 00:08:34,072
Keyin soat 11 da uxlashga yotaman.

149
00:08:34,095 --> 00:08:36,985
Dam olish kunlarida qayerga borasiz?

150
00:08:37,008 --> 00:08:40,775
Shanba kuni Kiotoga boraman.

151
00:08:40,798 --> 00:08:44,670
Yakshanba kuni hech qayerga bormayman.

152
00:08:44,694 --> 00:08:47,027
Uyda dam olaman.

153
00:08:47,050 --> 00:08:51,663
Jon-san, siz har kuni soat nechada turasiz?

154
00:08:51,686 --> 00:08:55,719
Jon har kuni soat 6 da turadi.

155
00:08:55,742 --> 00:08:58,430
Nonushta qilasizmi?

156
00:08:58,454 --> 00:08:59,889
Ha.

157
00:08:59,912 --> 00:09:03,482
Jon nonushta qiladi.

158
00:09:03,506 --> 00:09:07,039
Jon ham maktabga boradimi?

159
00:09:07,062 --> 00:09:08,429
Ha.

160
00:09:08,452 --> 00:09:11,660
Jon ham maktabga boradi.

161
00:09:11,683 --> 00:09:13,982
Necha soatda uxlayapsiz?

162
00:09:14,005 --> 00:09:16,372
Soat 10 da uxlayman.

163
00:09:16,395 --> 00:09:17,895
Sahna 5: Sevimli mashgʻulotlar haqida / Sevimli mashgʻulotlar haqida suhbat

164
00:09:17,895 --> 00:09:22,361
Jon-san, koʻpincha kinoga borasizmi?

165
00:09:22,384 --> 00:09:27,318
Yoʻq, men umuman kino koʻrmayman.

166
00:09:27,341 --> 00:09:31,143
Tanaka-san, siz koʻpincha kinoga borasizmi?

167
00:09:31,166 --> 00:09:35,966
Ha, men koʻpincha kinoga boraman.

168
00:09:35,989 --> 00:09:38,680
Dam olish kunlarida koʻp koʻraman.

169
00:09:38,704 --> 00:09:42,992
Ertaga birga kinoga boramizmi?

170
00:09:43,015 --> 00:09:45,149
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

171
00:09:45,172 --> 00:09:47,415
Birga koʻramiz.

172
00:09:47,438 --> 00:09:52,089
Jon-san, koʻpincha sport bilan shugʻullanasizmi?

173
00:09:52,112 --> 00:09:56,795
Yoʻq, sport bilan umuman shugʻullanmayman.

174
00:09:56,819 --> 00:09:58,833
Shundaymi?

175
00:09:58,857 --> 00:10:03,223
Unda, koʻpincha ichkilik ichasizmi?

176
00:10:03,246 --> 00:10:07,520
Yoʻq, ichkilik ham umuman ichmayman.

177
00:10:07,544 --> 00:10:12,559
Men koʻpincha kafeda kofe ichaman.

178
00:10:12,583 --> 00:10:14,452
Kafe degani?

179
00:10:14,475 --> 00:10:19,342
Bugun tushdan keyin birga kofe ichamizmi?

180
00:10:19,365 --> 00:10:21,448
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

181
00:10:21,471 --> 00:10:23,238
Boramiz!

182
00:10:23,261 --> 00:10:28,261
Jon-san, koʻpincha yapon jurnallarini oʻqiysizmi?

183
00:10:28,284 --> 00:10:33,517
Yoʻq, yapon jurnallarini umuman oʻqimayman.

184
00:10:33,540 --> 00:10:37,794
Lekin yaponcha kitoblarni koʻp oʻqiyman.

185
00:10:37,818 --> 00:10:40,184
Ajoyib!

186
00:10:40,207 --> 00:10:46,241
Unda, bugun kechqurun birga yapon tilini oʻrganamizmi?

187
00:10:46,263 --> 00:10:50,030
Ha, birga oʻrganamiz.

188
00:10:50,053 --> 00:10:54,305
Jon-san, koʻpincha musiqa tinglayapsizmi?

189
00:10:54,328 --> 00:10:58,328
Ha, koʻpincha musiqa tinglayman.

190
00:10:58,351 --> 00:11:00,185
Har kuni tinglayman.

191
00:11:00,208 --> 00:11:05,305
Unda, keyingi safar birga musiqa tinglaymizmi?

192
00:11:05,329 --> 00:11:07,062
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

193
00:11:07,085 --> 00:11:09,501
Birga tinglaymiz.

194
00:11:09,524 --> 00:11:13,091
Ertalab koʻpincha gazeta oʻqiysizmi?

195
00:11:13,114 --> 00:11:17,647
Yoʻq, gazeta umuman oʻqimayman.

196
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:19,170
Sahna 6: Narsalar va odamlarning joylashuvi / Narsalar va odamlarning joylashuvi haqida

197
00:11:19,170 --> 00:11:24,823
Voy, bu yerda turli xil narsalar bor ekan!

198
00:11:24,847 --> 00:11:29,385
Ha, mening xonamda turli xil narsalar bor.

199
00:11:29,408 --> 00:11:32,942
Bu yerda nima bor?

200
00:11:32,965 --> 00:11:36,371
Bu yerda stol bor.

201
00:11:36,394 --> 00:11:39,994
Stol ustida nima bor?

202
00:11:40,017 --> 00:11:43,833
Stol ustida kitob bor.

203
00:11:43,857 --> 00:11:47,857
Kitob yonida nima bor?

204
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:51,613
Kitob yonida ruchka bor.

205
00:11:51,636 --> 00:11:55,124
Sinfxonada kim bor?

206
00:11:55,148 --> 00:11:59,314
Sinfxonada Smit-san bor.

207
00:11:59,337 --> 00:12:03,137
Smit-san yonida kim bor?

208
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:07,393
Smit-san yonida Jon-san bor.

209
00:12:07,416 --> 00:12:11,383
Jon-san orqasida kim bor?

210
00:12:11,406 --> 00:12:15,773
Jon-san orqasida Meri-san bor.

211
00:12:15,796 --> 00:12:19,396
U yerda nima bor?

212
00:12:19,419 --> 00:12:22,619
Voy, lugʻat bor ekan.

213
00:12:22,642 --> 00:12:25,216
Qaysi lugʻat?

214
00:12:25,239 --> 00:12:27,472
Ana oʻsha.

215
00:12:27,495 --> 00:12:29,664
Bu Tanaka-san lugʻati.

216
00:12:29,687 --> 00:12:34,254
Yoʻq, bu lugʻat emas.

217
00:12:34,277 --> 00:12:36,144
Kitob.

218
00:12:36,167 --> 00:12:39,461
Ah, kitob ekan.

219
00:12:39,485 --> 00:12:44,619
Ha, stul ostida nima bor?

220
00:12:44,642 --> 00:12:47,208
Sumka bor.

221
00:12:47,231 --> 00:12:50,831
Sumkaning ichida nima bor?

222
00:12:50,854 --> 00:12:53,388
Daftar bor.

223
00:12:53,411 --> 00:12:57,380
Daftarlar orasida nima bor?

224
00:12:57,403 --> 00:12:59,636
Rasm bor.

225
00:12:59,659 --> 00:13:02,154
Bu kimning rasmi?

226
00:13:02,177 --> 00:13:05,419
Bu mening oilamning rasmi.

227
00:13:05,443 --> 00:13:08,909
Oilangiz qayerda?

228
00:13:08,932 --> 00:13:11,302
Amerikada.

229
00:13:11,326 --> 00:13:14,302
Doʻstlaringiz qayerda?

230
00:13:14,325 --> 00:13:16,737
Londonda.

231
00:13:16,761 --> 00:13:19,794
Smit-san qayerda?

232
00:13:19,817 --> 00:13:21,883
Shu yerda.

233
00:13:21,906 --> 00:13:23,406
7-sahna: Yakshanba kuni Kyotoga sayohat

234
00:13:23,406 --> 00:13:28,940
Kecha qaysi kun edi?

235
00:13:28,963 --> 00:13:32,045
Kecha yakshanba edi.

236
00:13:32,068 --> 00:13:36,235
Yakshanba kuni nima qildingiz?

237
00:13:36,258 --> 00:13:40,191
Men Kyotoga bordim.

238
00:13:40,214 --> 00:13:43,985
Kyotoda nima qildingiz?

239
00:13:44,009 --> 00:13:47,743
Men ibodatxonada surat oldim.

240
00:13:47,766 --> 00:13:51,403
Suratni yolgʻiz oʻzingiz oldingizmi?

241
00:13:51,426 --> 00:13:55,760
Yoʻq, doʻstim bilan surat oldim.

242
00:13:55,782 --> 00:13:59,549
Doʻstingiz kim edi?

243
00:13:59,572 --> 00:14:03,939
Doʻstim Jon-san edi.

244
00:14:03,962 --> 00:14:07,528
Jon-san ham surat oldimi?

245
00:14:07,551 --> 00:14:11,636
Ha, Jon-san ham surat oldi.

246
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:15,593
Tushlik nima boʻldi?

247
00:14:15,616 --> 00:14:19,349
Tushlikda baliq yedim.

248
00:14:19,372 --> 00:14:22,815
Baliqni qayerda yedingiz?

249
00:14:22,839 --> 00:14:26,116
Kyotodagi restoranda yedim.

250
00:14:26,139 --> 00:14:29,554
Restoranda odamlar bormi edi?

251
00:14:29,578 --> 00:14:33,511
Ha, restoranda odamlar bor edi.

252
00:14:33,534 --> 00:14:37,667
Necha soatda uyga qaytdingiz?

253
00:14:37,690 --> 00:14:40,624
Soat toʻqqizda uyga qaytdim.

254
00:14:40,647 --> 00:14:43,736
Keyin nima qildingiz?

255
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:47,567
Keyin televizor koʻrdim.

256
00:14:47,590 --> 00:14:50,327
Necha soatda uxladingiz?

257
00:14:50,351 --> 00:14:53,122
Soat oʻn birda uxladim.

258
00:14:53,146 --> 00:14:56,579
Bilan kecha nima qildingiz?

259
00:14:56,602 --> 00:15:00,069
Bilan kecha shanba kuni edi.

260
00:15:00,091 --> 00:15:03,898
Shanba kuni ham Kyotoga bordingizmi?

261
00:15:03,922 --> 00:15:09,174
Yoʻq, shanba kuni hech qayerga bormadim.

262
00:15:09,198 --> 00:15:12,932
Uyda nima qildingiz?

263
00:15:12,955 --> 00:15:16,571
Uyda yapon tilini oʻrgandim.

264
00:15:16,595 --> 00:15:19,829
Har kuni oʻqiyman.

265
00:15:19,852 --> 00:15:22,818
Har kuni oʻqiysizmi?

266
00:15:22,841 --> 00:15:26,408
Ha, har kuni.

267
00:15:26,431 --> 00:15:27,931
8-sahna: Uchrashuv kechikishi va xaridlar / Uchrashuvning kechikishi va xarid qilish

268
00:15:27,931 --> 00:15:31,498
Smith-san, kechikdingiz-ku.

269
00:15:31,521 --> 00:15:33,758
Kechirasiz

270
00:15:33,781 --> 00:15:38,147
Men bu yerda bir soat kutdim-ku.

271
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:40,981
Rostdan uzr, kechikib qoldim.

272
00:15:41,005 --> 00:15:44,886
Stansiyada odamlar koʻp edi-mi?

273
00:15:44,910 --> 00:15:49,343
Ha, stansiyada odamlar koʻp edi.

274
00:15:49,366 --> 00:15:52,766
Avtobuslar ham koʻp edi-mi?

275
00:15:52,789 --> 00:15:56,767
Ha, avtobuslar ham koʻp edi.

276
00:15:56,791 --> 00:15:59,685
Mashinalar ham koʻp edi.

277
00:15:59,708 --> 00:16:02,042
Shundaymi?

278
00:16:02,065 --> 00:16:06,114
Kecha kitoblar koʻp sotib oldingizmi?

279
00:16:06,137 --> 00:16:10,904
Ha, yaponcha kitoblar koʻp sotib oldim.

280
00:16:10,927 --> 00:16:13,413
Necha dona sotib oldingiz?

281
00:16:13,436 --> 00:16:16,170
Besh dona sotib oldim.

282
00:16:16,193 --> 00:16:18,770
Lugʻat ham sotib oldingizmi?

283
00:16:18,793 --> 00:16:22,830
Ha, lugʻat ham bitta sotib oldim.

284
00:16:22,853 --> 00:16:27,420
Smith-san uyida kitoblar koʻp ekan-ku.

285
00:16:27,443 --> 00:16:32,111
Ha, uyimda kitoblar koʻp.

286
00:16:32,134 --> 00:16:35,172
Inglizcha kitoblar ham koʻp.

287
00:16:35,196 --> 00:16:39,045
Doʻstlaringiz ham koʻpmi?

288
00:16:39,069 --> 00:16:42,802
Ha, Amerikadagi doʻstlarim koʻp.

289
00:16:42,825 --> 00:16:46,475
Yapondagi doʻstlarim ham koʻp.

290
00:16:46,498 --> 00:16:49,970
Har kuni necha soat oʻqiysiz?

291
00:16:49,993 --> 00:16:53,760
Har kuni uch soat oʻqiyman.

292
00:16:53,783 --> 00:16:58,416
Uch soatmi? Koʻp oʻqiysiz-ku.

293
00:16:58,439 --> 00:17:02,973
Ha, har kuni koʻp oʻqiyman.

294
00:17:02,996 --> 00:17:06,482
Kecha ham koʻp oʻqidingizmi?

295
00:17:06,505 --> 00:17:10,958
Yoʻq, kecha bir soat oʻqidim.

296
00:17:10,982 --> 00:17:15,193
Kecha yakshanba edi-ku.

297
00:17:15,216 --> 00:17:19,432
Ha, yakshanba kun koʻp dam oldim.

298
00:17:19,455 --> 00:17:20,955
9-sahna: Yapon taomlari va oʻrganish / Yapon taomlari va oʻrganish

299
00:17:20,955 --> 00:17:24,989
Yapon taomlari mazali-mi?

300
00:17:25,012 --> 00:17:28,945
Ha, juda mazali.

301
00:17:28,968 --> 00:17:32,057
Sushi mazali-mi?

302
00:17:32,081 --> 00:17:36,847
Ha, sushi juda mazali.

303
00:17:36,870 --> 00:17:39,604
Ramen qanday?

304
00:17:39,627 --> 00:17:43,093
Ramen ham mazali.

305
00:17:43,116 --> 00:17:46,483
Lekin, biroz achchiq.

306
00:17:46,506 --> 00:17:50,539
Yapon tili oʻrganish qiziqarli-mi?

307
00:17:50,562 --> 00:17:56,229
Ha, yapon tili oʻrganish juda qiziqarli.

308
00:17:56,253 --> 00:18:00,419
Kanji qiyin-mi?

309
00:18:00,442 --> 00:18:05,076
Ha, kanji juda qiyin.

310
00:18:05,099 --> 00:18:07,596
Katakana qanday?

311
00:18:07,619 --> 00:18:11,019
Katakana qiyin emas.

312
00:18:11,042 --> 00:18:12,877
Oson.

313
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:16,467
Tokio chiroyli shahar-mi?

314
00:18:16,490 --> 00:18:21,657
Ha, Tokio juda chiroyli shahar.

315
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:24,213
Kioto qanday?

316
00:18:24,236 --> 00:18:27,570
Kyoto ham goʻzal shahar.

317
00:18:27,594 --> 00:18:30,672
Bu yerda koʻp qadimiy ibodatxonalar bor.

318
00:18:30,695 --> 00:18:35,345
Smit-san, sizning maktabingiz kattami?

319
00:18:35,369 --> 00:18:40,835
Ha, mening maktabim juda katta.

320
00:18:40,858 --> 00:18:43,732
Sinflar yangi-mi?

321
00:18:43,756 --> 00:18:49,044
Ha, sinflar juda yangi.

322
00:18:49,067 --> 00:18:51,924
Oʻqituvchingiz qattiqmi?

323
00:18:51,948 --> 00:18:57,314
Yoʻq, mening oʻqituvchim qattiq emas.

324
00:18:57,337 --> 00:18:59,504
Juda mehribon.

325
00:18:59,527 --> 00:19:03,207
Smit-san, uyingiz yangi-mi?

326
00:19:03,230 --> 00:19:08,464
Yoʻq, mening uyim yangi emas.

327
00:19:08,487 --> 00:19:10,253
Qadimiy.

328
00:19:10,276 --> 00:19:12,843
Xonalar kengmi?

329
00:19:12,866 --> 00:19:17,364
Yoʻq, xonalar keng emas.

330
00:19:17,387 --> 00:19:19,073
Tortiq.

331
00:19:19,097 --> 00:19:22,097
Har kuni bandmisiz?

332
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:27,001
Ha, har kuni juda bandman.

333
00:19:27,024 --> 00:19:29,678
Bugun issiqmi?

334
00:19:29,702 --> 00:19:34,069
Yoʻq, bugun issiq emas.

335
00:19:34,092 --> 00:19:36,337
Salqinroq.

336
00:19:36,361 --> 00:19:37,861
10-sahna: Smit-sanning sevimli narsalari

337
00:19:37,861 --> 00:19:41,794
Smit-san, goʻsht yoqadimi?

338
00:19:41,817 --> 00:19:46,250
Ha, men goʻshtni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

339
00:19:46,273 --> 00:19:48,707
Baliq-chiq qanday?

340
00:19:48,730 --> 00:19:52,819
Baliqni unchalik yaxshi koʻrmayman.

341
00:19:52,842 --> 00:19:55,609
Sabzavotlar yoqadimi?

342
00:19:55,632 --> 00:19:59,798
Yoʻq, sabzavotlarni yoqtirmayman.

343
00:19:59,821 --> 00:20:03,794
Qaysi taomni eng yaxshi koʻrasiz?

344
00:20:03,818 --> 00:20:07,252
Tempura eng sevimlim.

345
00:20:07,275 --> 00:20:10,372
Qaysi ichimlikni yaxshi koʻrasiz?

346
00:20:10,395 --> 00:20:12,961
Kofeni yaxshi koʻraman.

347
00:20:12,985 --> 00:20:15,418
Choy yoqtirmayman.

348
00:20:15,441 --> 00:20:18,328
Qaysi sport turini yaxshi koʻrasiz?

349
00:20:18,352 --> 00:20:21,188
Futbolni yaxshi koʻraman.

350
00:20:21,212 --> 00:20:23,812
Tennisni yoqtirmayman.

351
00:20:23,835 --> 00:20:27,768
Smit-san, qoʻshiq aytishda mohirmisiz?

352
00:20:27,791 --> 00:20:32,791
Yoʻq, men qoʻshiq aytishda yaxshi emasman.

353
00:20:32,814 --> 00:20:34,432
Yomon.

354
00:20:34,455 --> 00:20:38,289
Jon-san qoʻshiq aytishda mohirmidi?

355
00:20:38,312 --> 00:20:43,446
Ha, Jon-san qoʻshiq aytishda juda mohir.

356
00:20:43,470 --> 00:20:47,480
Smit-san, ovqat pishirishda mohirmisiz?

357
00:20:47,503 --> 00:20:52,080
Ha, men ovqat pishirishda mohorman.

358
00:20:52,104 --> 00:20:54,918
Har kuni ovqat pishiraman.

359
00:20:54,941 --> 00:20:57,316
Ajoyib!

360
00:20:57,340 --> 00:21:00,306
Yapon tilini yaxshi bilasizmi?

361
00:21:00,329 --> 00:21:05,147
Yoʻq, yapon tilini hali yaxshi bilmayman.

362
00:21:05,171 --> 00:21:06,744
Yomon.

363
00:21:06,767 --> 00:21:09,167
Ingliz tili-chiq qanday?

364
00:21:09,190 --> 00:21:13,823
Ingliz tili mening ona tilim, shuning uchun yaxshi bilaman.

365
00:21:13,846 --> 00:21:18,013
Bugungi tushlikda tempura yeyishni taklif qilaman.

366
00:21:18,036 --> 00:21:19,907
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

367
00:21:19,931 --> 00:21:22,264
Tempura yeyamiz.

368
00:21:22,287 --> 00:21:25,020
U yerda boramiz.

369
00:21:25,043 --> 00:21:29,777
Ha, shu chiroyli doʻkonga boring.

370
00:21:29,799 --> 00:21:32,933
U yerda kofe ham ichamiz.

371
00:21:32,956 --> 00:21:36,125
Ha, birga ichamiz.

372
00:21:36,149 --> 00:21:37,649
11-Sahna: Yoʻl koʻrsatish asoslari / Yapon tilida yoʻl soʻrash

373
00:21:37,649 --> 00:21:39,649
Kechirasiz

374
00:21:39,672 --> 00:21:43,284
Iltimos, menga yoʻlni ayting.

375
00:21:43,307 --> 00:21:46,274
Ha, albatta.

376
00:21:46,297 --> 00:21:48,663
Qayerga borasiz?

377
00:21:48,686 --> 00:21:50,941
Vokzalga boraman.

378
00:21:50,965 --> 00:21:54,299
Lekin yoʻlni bilmayman.

379
00:21:54,323 --> 00:21:56,589
Vokzalmi?

380
00:21:56,612 --> 00:22:00,746
Vokzal bu yerdan biroz uzoqda.

381
00:22:00,769 --> 00:22:03,035
Shundaymi?

382
00:22:03,059 --> 00:22:06,825
Men hozir juda qiynalayapman.

383
00:22:06,848 --> 00:22:11,068
Unda, bu eski xaritaga qarang.

384
00:22:11,091 --> 00:22:13,825
Ha, qarayapman.

385
00:22:13,848 --> 00:22:18,022
Biz hozir shu yerda turibmiz.

386
00:22:18,046 --> 00:22:20,123
Shu joymi?

387
00:22:20,147 --> 00:22:22,313
Tushunarli.

388
00:22:22,336 --> 00:22:26,870
Avvalo, bu yoʻldan toʻgʻri boring.

389
00:22:26,893 --> 00:22:29,459
Toʻgʻri boraman.

390
00:22:29,482 --> 00:22:35,020
Keyin, u katta chorrahadan oʻngga buriling.

391
00:22:35,044 --> 00:22:37,423
Oʻngga, shundaymi?

392
00:22:37,447 --> 00:22:42,256
Ha, u yerda eski bank bor.

393
00:22:42,280 --> 00:22:45,613
Oq binomi?

394
00:22:45,636 --> 00:22:49,769
Yoʻq, koʻk bino.

395
00:22:49,792 --> 00:22:51,769
Tushunarli.

396
00:22:51,792 --> 00:22:56,359
Bank yonida yangi univermag bor.

397
00:22:56,382 --> 00:22:58,551
Univermagmi?

398
00:22:58,575 --> 00:23:03,708
Ha, univermag oldida avtobus bekat bor.

399
00:23:03,731 --> 00:23:05,946
Avtobus bekatmi?

400
00:23:05,970 --> 00:23:11,171
Ha, u yerdan birinchi avtobusga chiqing.

401
00:23:11,194 --> 00:23:13,995
Birinchi avtobusmi?

402
00:23:14,018 --> 00:23:19,194
U avtobus vokzalga boradi, juda qulay.

403
00:23:19,217 --> 00:23:21,684
Avtobusda necha daqiqa ketadi?

404
00:23:21,707 --> 00:23:24,722
5 daqiqa atrofida.

405
00:23:24,745 --> 00:23:28,145
Yaqin ekan, tez yetib borasiz.

406
00:23:28,168 --> 00:23:30,001
Yaxshi boʻldi.

407
00:23:30,024 --> 00:23:31,827
Yengilladim.

408
00:23:31,850 --> 00:23:37,417
Bugun juda issiq, koʻp suv iching.

409
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:39,929
Ha, shunday qilaman.

410
00:23:39,953 --> 00:23:43,519
Xoʻsh, ehtiyot boʻling.

411
00:23:43,542 --> 00:23:46,996
Rahmat, juda koʻp rahm-shafqat.

412
00:23:47,019 --> 00:23:48,519
12-Sahna: Ruxsat soʻrash suhbati / Suhbatda ruxsat soʻrash

413
00:23:48,519 --> 00:23:50,519
Kechirasiz

414
00:23:50,542 --> 00:23:54,216
Bu yerda rasm olish mumkinmi?

415
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:59,131
Yoʻq, bu yerda rasm olish mumkin emas.

416
00:23:59,154 --> 00:24:02,001
A, shundaymi?

417
00:24:02,024 --> 00:24:04,191
Nega?

418
00:24:04,214 --> 00:24:10,014
Bu yerda koʻp eski rasmlar bor.

419
00:24:10,037 --> 00:24:11,672
Tushunarli.

420
00:24:11,696 --> 00:24:15,729
Unda, u yerga kirish mumkinmi?

421
00:24:15,752 --> 00:24:20,559
Yoʻq, u yerga kirish mumkin emas.

422
00:24:20,582 --> 00:24:23,116
U yer ham mumkin emasmi?

423
00:24:23,139 --> 00:24:29,139
Ha, u yer kompaniya direktori xonasi.

424
00:24:29,162 --> 00:24:30,775
Tushunarli.

425
00:24:30,798 --> 00:24:35,031
Unda, qayerda dam olish mumkin?

426
00:24:35,054 --> 00:24:38,343
Dam olish xonasi u yerda.

427
00:24:38,366 --> 00:24:41,933
U yerda sigaret chekishingiz mumkin.

428
00:24:41,956 --> 00:24:44,589
Choy ichsam bo‘ladimi?

429
00:24:44,612 --> 00:24:46,281
Ha.

430
00:24:46,305 --> 00:24:49,601
Choy ham, sharbat ham bo‘ladi.

431
00:24:49,625 --> 00:24:51,960
Ko‘p bor, shuning uchun olishingiz mumkin.

432
00:24:51,983 --> 00:24:54,117
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

433
00:24:54,140 --> 00:24:57,475
Bu kompyuterni ishlatsam bo‘ladimi?

434
00:24:57,498 --> 00:25:02,965
Yo‘q, bu kompyuterni ishlatmang.

435
00:25:02,988 --> 00:25:05,562
Bu kimning kompyuteri?

436
00:25:05,585 --> 00:25:08,852
Tanaka-san kompyuteri.

437
00:25:08,875 --> 00:25:11,441
Unga tegmang.

438
00:25:11,464 --> 00:25:13,300
Tushunarli.

439
00:25:13,324 --> 00:25:17,691
Unda, o‘z smartfonimga qaramasam bo‘ladimi?

440
00:25:17,714 --> 00:25:19,450
Ha.

441
00:25:19,473 --> 00:25:22,307
Smartfon bo‘ladi.

442
00:25:22,330 --> 00:25:24,426
Yaxshi boʻldi.

443
00:25:24,449 --> 00:25:29,699
Ish vaqtida o‘ynamang.

444
00:25:29,723 --> 00:25:32,332
Ha, tushunarli.

445
00:25:32,356 --> 00:25:34,189
E’tibor beraman.

446
00:25:34,212 --> 00:25:39,079
Shunday bo‘lsa, soat 12 da u yerga keling.

447
00:25:39,102 --> 00:25:41,768
Ha, tushunarli.

448
00:25:41,791 --> 00:25:44,358
Iltimos, yaxshi qilib qo‘ying.

449
00:25:44,381 --> 00:25:45,881
13-Sahna: Telefon suhbati

450
00:25:45,881 --> 00:25:50,097
Allo, hozir nima qilyapsan?

451
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:55,559
Allo, hozir uyda musiqa tinglayapman.

452
00:25:55,582 --> 00:25:57,228
Yaxshi ekan.

453
00:25:57,251 --> 00:26:00,385
Qanday musiqa tinglayapsan?

454
00:26:00,408 --> 00:26:04,492
Yaponiyaning eski qo‘shiqlarini tinglayapman.

455
00:26:04,515 --> 00:26:06,281
Shundaymi.

456
00:26:06,304 --> 00:26:09,271
Ovqatni allaqachon yidingmi?

457
00:26:09,294 --> 00:26:11,061
Ha.

458
00:26:11,084 --> 00:26:14,284
Yaqinda bentoni yedim.

459
00:26:14,307 --> 00:26:17,164
Bugun qayerga chiqdingmi?

460
00:26:17,187 --> 00:26:19,254
Hmm.

461
00:26:19,277 --> 00:26:24,526
Bugun yomg‘ir yog‘ayapti, shuning uchun butun kun uyda edim.

462
00:26:24,550 --> 00:26:26,124
Shundaymi.

463
00:26:26,147 --> 00:26:29,514
Mark-san hozir nima qilyapti?

464
00:26:29,537 --> 00:26:34,580
Mark-san hozir qo‘shnidagi xonada uxlayapti.

465
00:26:34,603 --> 00:26:37,471
E, allaqachon uxlayapti?

466
00:26:37,494 --> 00:26:39,694
Erta ekan-ku.

467
00:26:39,717 --> 00:26:41,650
Ha.

468
00:26:41,673 --> 00:26:47,807
Bugun ertalabdan ko‘p ishladim, shuning uchun juda charchadim.

469
00:26:47,830 --> 00:26:49,763
Shundaymi.

470
00:26:49,786 --> 00:26:52,953
Ertaga soat nechada turasan?

471
00:26:52,976 --> 00:26:56,619
Ertaga soat 6 da turaman.

472
00:26:56,642 --> 00:26:59,128
Erta ekan.

473
00:26:59,151 --> 00:27:01,318
Ertaga ham ishmi?

474
00:27:01,341 --> 00:27:03,189
Ha.

475
00:27:03,212 --> 00:27:06,745
Ertaga ham ertalabdan ish bor.

476
00:27:06,768 --> 00:27:09,035
Qiyin ekan.

477
00:27:09,058 --> 00:27:12,591
Hozir tashqarida hali ham yomg‘ir yog‘ayapti?

478
00:27:12,614 --> 00:27:14,448
Ha.

479
00:27:14,471 --> 00:27:17,743
Hali ham ko‘p yog‘ayapti.

480
00:27:17,767 --> 00:27:20,007
Shamol ham kuchli.

481
00:27:20,030 --> 00:27:23,438
Shunday bo‘lsa, chiqib ketolmaymiz.

482
00:27:23,461 --> 00:27:25,529
Shundaymi.

483
00:27:25,553 --> 00:27:29,489
Shuning uchun uyda kitob o‘qiyapman.

484
00:27:29,512 --> 00:27:32,712
Qanday kitob o‘qiyapsan?

485
00:27:32,735 --> 00:27:36,668
Yapon tili darsligini o‘qiyapman.

486
00:27:36,691 --> 00:27:38,225
Buyuk ish qilyapsiz!

487
00:27:38,248 --> 00:27:41,281
Oʻqishni davom ettir, omad!

488
00:27:41,304 --> 00:27:42,798
Rahmat.

489
00:27:42,822 --> 00:27:45,355
Keyinroq aloqada boʻlamiz.

490
00:27:45,378 --> 00:27:46,878
14-SAHNA: OILAMNI TANISHTIRISH

491
00:27:46,878 --> 00:27:50,568
Bu kimning surati?

492
00:27:50,591 --> 00:27:55,225
Bu mening oilamning surati.

493
00:27:55,248 --> 00:27:58,663
Vov, ajoyib surat ekan!

494
00:27:58,686 --> 00:28:01,886
Oilangizda necha kishi bor?

495
00:28:01,909 --> 00:28:05,320
Oilamizda toʻrt kishi bor.

496
00:28:05,344 --> 00:28:09,184
Xotinim va ikki farzandim bor.

497
00:28:09,207 --> 00:28:13,090
Bu baland boʻyli odam kim?

498
00:28:13,114 --> 00:28:16,880
Bu mening oʻgʻlim.

499
00:28:16,903 --> 00:28:20,270
Oʻgʻlingizning koʻzi katta ekan-ku!

500
00:28:20,293 --> 00:28:25,582
Ha, oʻgʻlimning sochi uzun.

501
00:28:25,606 --> 00:28:29,139
Va qoʻshiq aytishda ham zoʻr!

502
00:28:29,162 --> 00:28:31,261
Yaxshi ekan.

503
00:28:31,285 --> 00:28:35,485
Bu chiroyli qizaloq kim?

504
00:28:35,508 --> 00:28:39,041
Bu mening qizim.

505
00:28:39,064 --> 00:28:42,731
Qizim bu yil 6 yoshda.

506
00:28:42,754 --> 00:28:46,587
Qizingizning qoʻli kichik ekan!

507
00:28:46,610 --> 00:28:52,856
Ha. Qizim hozir har kuni maktabga boradi.

508
00:28:52,879 --> 00:28:55,246
Har kunimi?

509
00:28:55,269 --> 00:28:58,436
Juda gavjum boʻlsa kerak!

510
00:28:58,459 --> 00:29:02,592
Ha. Har kuni juda gavjum.

511
00:29:02,615 --> 00:29:05,548
Xotiniz qayerda?

512
00:29:05,571 --> 00:29:09,771
Xotinim bu oʻngdagisi.

513
00:29:09,794 --> 00:29:13,128
Xotiniz jim odammi?

514
00:29:13,152 --> 00:29:17,620
Yoʻq, xotinim gapni koʻp qiladi.

515
00:29:17,643 --> 00:29:20,416
Juda sergʻayrat odam.

516
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:24,687
Shundaymi, qiziqarli oilangiz ekan!

517
00:29:24,711 --> 00:29:30,111
Ha. Oilamizdagi hamma fotografiyani yaxshi koʻradi.

518
00:29:30,134 --> 00:29:34,753
Shuning uchun yaxshi suratlar koʻp ekan!

519
00:29:34,777 --> 00:29:38,629
Ha. Har kuni suratga tushamiz.

520
00:29:38,652 --> 00:29:41,300
Raxmatli oilangizga hasad qilaman.

521
00:29:41,324 --> 00:29:45,793
Mening oilam hozir Vetnamda.

522
00:29:45,816 --> 00:29:49,817
Shundaymi, yolgʻizlik his qilasizmi?

523
00:29:49,841 --> 00:29:55,379
Ha. Ammo har kuni telefon orqali gaplashamiz.

524
00:29:55,402 --> 00:29:56,902
15-SAHNA: YAKSHANBAGI FOTOGRAFIYA SAYOHATI

525
00:29:56,902 --> 00:30:01,195
Navbatdagi yakshanba kuningizda rejangiz nima?

526
00:30:01,219 --> 00:30:07,785
Navbatdagi yakshanbada bogʻga suratga tushishga boramiz.

527
00:30:07,808 --> 00:30:09,688
Bogʻdami?

528
00:30:09,712 --> 00:30:11,545
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

529
00:30:11,568 --> 00:30:14,207
Qaysi bogʻ?

530
00:30:14,230 --> 00:30:19,564
Shahar markazidagi katta bogʻ.

531
00:30:19,587 --> 00:30:24,323
U yer tinch va chiroyli, yaxshi tanlov!

532
00:30:24,346 --> 00:30:31,512
Ha. Navbatdagi yakshanba ob-havo yaxshi va salqin boʻladi.

533
00:30:31,535 --> 00:30:34,735
Kimlar bilan borasiz?

534
00:30:34,758 --> 00:30:38,958
Doʻstim Mark bilan boramiz.

535
00:30:38,981 --> 00:30:42,348
Mark ham kamerasi bormi?

536
00:30:42,371 --> 00:30:43,841
Ha.

537
00:30:43,865 --> 00:30:49,398
Mark yangi va katta kamera sotib oldi.

538
00:30:49,421 --> 00:30:51,621
Shundaymi?

539
00:30:51,644 --> 00:30:55,577
Men ham oʻsha bogʻga borishni xohlayman.

540
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:59,055
Xoʻsh, birga boring.

541
00:30:59,079 --> 00:31:01,116
Yaxshimi?

542
00:31:01,140 --> 00:31:03,173
Juda xursandman!

543
00:31:03,196 --> 00:31:08,196
Yakshanba kuni ertalab soat 9 da stansiya oldida uchrashamiz.

544
00:31:08,219 --> 00:31:10,287
Tushunarli.

545
00:31:10,311 --> 00:31:13,154
Stansiyaga qanday borasiz?

546
00:31:13,178 --> 00:31:16,311
Men velosipedda boraman.

547
00:31:16,334 --> 00:31:19,067
Stansiya yaqin joyda.

548
00:31:19,090 --> 00:31:21,890
Men avtobusda boraman.

549
00:31:21,913 --> 00:31:26,280
Avtobus qulay va arzon, yaxshi gʻoy.

550
00:31:26,303 --> 00:31:27,936
Ha.

551
00:31:27,959 --> 00:31:32,560
Bogʻ yaqinida mazali restoran bormi?

552
00:31:32,584 --> 00:31:34,455
Ha.

553
00:31:34,478 --> 00:31:39,812
Bogʻ oldida yangi va mazali restoran bor.

554
00:31:39,835 --> 00:31:43,235
Yangi va eski degani?

555
00:31:43,258 --> 00:31:45,858
Qiziqarli ekan!

556
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:50,337
U yerda karey arzon va juda mazali.

557
00:31:50,361 --> 00:31:55,100
Xoʻsh, tushlikni oʻsha yerda yeymiz.

558
00:31:55,123 --> 00:31:57,923
Ha, shunday qilamiz.

559
00:31:57,946 --> 00:32:00,439
Juda kutaman!

560
00:32:00,462 --> 00:32:01,962
16-SAHNA: Kino taassurotlari

561
00:32:01,962 --> 00:32:06,035
Kecha yangi film koʻrdim.

562
00:32:06,059 --> 00:32:07,711
Shundaymi?

563
00:32:07,734 --> 00:32:10,703
Qaysi filmni koʻrdingiz?

564
00:32:10,727 --> 00:32:14,460
Oʻsha mashhur animatsion film.

565
00:32:14,483 --> 00:32:17,516
Aa, oʻsha film.

566
00:32:17,539 --> 00:32:19,673
Qanday edi?

567
00:32:19,696 --> 00:32:25,096
Menga bu film biroz uzundek tuyuldi.

568
00:32:25,119 --> 00:32:28,552
Qancha uzun edi?

569
00:32:28,575 --> 00:32:31,387
Uch soat atrofida.

570
00:32:31,410 --> 00:32:33,943
Juda charchadim.

571
00:32:33,966 --> 00:32:37,500
Uch soat juda uzun.

572
00:32:37,523 --> 00:32:39,894
Qiziqarli edi mi?

573
00:32:39,917 --> 00:32:45,410
Hmm, unchalik qiziqarli emasdi, deb oʻylayman.

574
00:32:45,434 --> 00:32:48,116
Haa, shundaymi?

575
00:32:48,139 --> 00:32:51,306
Nega qiziqarli emasdi?

576
00:32:51,329 --> 00:32:55,147
Syujet biroz murakkab edi.

577
00:32:55,170 --> 00:32:57,805
Yaxshi tushunmadim.

578
00:32:57,829 --> 00:32:59,862
Tushunarli.

579
00:32:59,885 --> 00:33:03,485
Bolalar uchun murakkab syujet edi mi?

580
00:33:03,508 --> 00:33:04,975
Ha.

581
00:33:04,998 --> 00:33:08,731
Bolalar uchun juda murakkab boʻlardi, deb oʻylayman.

582
00:33:08,754 --> 00:33:11,572
Musiqa qanday edi?

583
00:33:11,595 --> 00:33:15,962
Musiqa juda chiroyli va yaxshi edi, deb oʻylayman.

584
00:33:15,985 --> 00:33:19,672
Musiqa yaxshi ekani ajoyib.

585
00:33:19,696 --> 00:33:24,496
Ha, lekin kinoteatr stullari qattiq edi.

586
00:33:24,519 --> 00:33:27,285
Bu qiyin boʻldi-ku.

587
00:33:27,308 --> 00:33:30,316
Dumaloqingiz ogʻrib ketmadi mi?

588
00:33:30,339 --> 00:33:31,906
Ha.

589
00:33:31,929 --> 00:33:35,227
Dumaloqim juda ogʻrib ketdi.

590
00:33:35,251 --> 00:33:40,231
Shuning uchun uch soat yanada uzunroq tuyuldi.

591
00:33:40,254 --> 00:33:42,331
Ha, shunday.

592
00:33:42,355 --> 00:33:45,208
Oʻrtalarida uyquim keldi.

593
00:33:45,231 --> 00:33:48,664
Kinoteatr qorongʻi boʻladi-ku.

594
00:33:48,687 --> 00:33:51,721
Men ham koʻpincha uyqu bosadi.

595
00:33:51,744 --> 00:33:55,977
Ammo, oxirigacha chidab ko'rdim.

596
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:57,835
Ajoyibsiz!

597
00:33:57,858 --> 00:34:01,392
Do'stingiz nima deyishdi?

598
00:34:01,415 --> 00:34:06,248
Do'stim juda qiziqarli ekanligini aytibdi.

599
00:34:06,271 --> 00:34:09,889
Har bir kishining fikri har xil ekan.

600
00:34:09,913 --> 00:34:15,648
Ha, do'stim keyingi hafta yana ko'raman, deydi.

601
00:34:15,671 --> 00:34:17,766
Rostdanmi?

602
00:34:17,790 --> 00:34:20,556
Juda yoqib ketgan ekan.

603
00:34:20,579 --> 00:34:22,227
Ha.

604
00:34:22,250 --> 00:34:25,653
Men esa yana ko'rmoqchi emasman.

605
00:34:25,677 --> 00:34:29,810
Keyingi film qisqa bo'lsa yaxshi bo'lardi.

606
00:34:29,833 --> 00:34:31,466
Ha, rostdan.

607
00:34:31,489 --> 00:34:36,130
Keyin quvnoq komediya filmini ko'rmoqchiman.

608
00:34:36,154 --> 00:34:38,233
Bu juda yaxshi g'oya.

609
00:34:38,256 --> 00:34:41,789
Navbatda men ham siz bilan borishni istayman.

610
00:34:41,812 --> 00:34:43,312
17-Sahna: Yig'ilish tayyorlash va ishlar / Yig'ilishga tayyorgarlik va rejalashtirish

611
00:34:43,312 --> 00:34:47,769
Bugun Mark bilan uchrashdingizmi?

612
00:34:47,792 --> 00:34:51,827
Yo'q, bugun hali uchrashmadim.

613
00:34:51,851 --> 00:34:54,339
Nima bo'ldi?

614
00:34:54,362 --> 00:35:01,530
Mark ertaga bu yerga kelolmasligini aytibdi.

615
00:35:01,553 --> 00:35:05,287
Eee, ertaga kelolmasmi?

616
00:35:05,310 --> 00:35:07,243
Nima uchun?

617
00:35:07,266 --> 00:35:14,204
Ertaga ertalabdan muhim ish borligini aytibdi.

618
00:35:14,227 --> 00:35:16,161
Shundaymi?

619
00:35:16,184 --> 00:35:19,584
Ertangi yig'ilishni qanday qilamiz?

620
00:35:19,607 --> 00:35:25,740
Yig'ilish materiallarini bugungi kun ichida tayyorlayman, deydi.

621
00:35:25,763 --> 00:35:28,412
Unda xotirjam bo'lsak bo'ladi.

622
00:35:28,435 --> 00:35:32,269
Mark hozir qayerda?

623
00:35:32,292 --> 00:35:37,058
Hozir boshqa xonada ishlayapti.

624
00:35:37,081 --> 00:35:38,781
Tushunarli.

625
00:35:38,804 --> 00:35:41,061
Keyinroq borib ko'raman.

626
00:35:41,084 --> 00:35:46,918
A, shundan so'ng, Mark sizga xabar qoldiribdi.

627
00:35:46,941 --> 00:35:49,074
Qanday xabar?

628
00:35:49,097 --> 00:35:54,264
Tanaka-sanga kitobni qaytarib qo'yganini aytibdi.

629
00:35:54,287 --> 00:35:56,087
Kitobmi?

630
00:35:56,110 --> 00:35:58,477
Qaysi kitob?

631
00:35:58,500 --> 00:36:02,466
Yaponcha lug'at ekanligini aytibdi.

632
00:36:02,489 --> 00:36:04,124
Tushunarli.

633
00:36:04,147 --> 00:36:06,590
Tanaka-sanga yetkazaman.

634
00:36:06,614 --> 00:36:08,694
Iltimos, yaxshi qilib qo‘ying.

635
00:36:08,718 --> 00:36:12,685
Mark juda shoshilyapti.

636
00:36:12,708 --> 00:36:15,741
Ishga tayyorgarlik ko'rayotgan ekan.

637
00:36:15,764 --> 00:36:22,036
Yo'q, bu hafta davomida doimo band ekanligini aytibdi.

638
00:36:22,059 --> 00:36:25,116
Sog'ligi joyidami?

639
00:36:25,140 --> 00:36:26,550
Xavotirdaman.

640
00:36:26,574 --> 00:36:32,857
Har kecha yaxshi uxlayapman, demagani uchun xotirjam bo'lsak bo'ladi, deydi.

641
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:35,485
Buni eshitib, xotirjam bo'ldim.

642
00:36:35,509 --> 00:36:41,043
Keyingi hafta dushanba kuni erta kelaman, deydi.

643
00:36:41,066 --> 00:36:42,866
Tushunarli.

644
00:36:42,889 --> 00:36:45,364
Dushanba kuni yana gaplashamiz.

645
00:36:45,387 --> 00:36:46,847
Ha.

646
00:36:46,871 --> 00:36:49,204
Xabar shu qadar.

647
00:36:49,227 --> 00:36:51,828
Aytib berganingiz uchun raxmat.

648
00:36:51,852 --> 00:36:56,866
Arzimaydi, yana nimadir bo'lsa, aytaman.

649
00:36:56,889 --> 00:36:58,123
Ha.

650
00:36:58,146 --> 00:37:00,346
Iltimos, yaxshi qilib qo‘ying.

651
00:37:00,369 --> 00:37:01,869
18-Sahna: Sevimli mashgʻulotlar va pazandalik / Sevimli mashgʻulotlar va ovqat tayyorlash

652
00:37:01,869 --> 00:37:05,202
Sevimli mashgʻulotingiz nima?

653
00:37:05,225 --> 00:37:09,431
Mening sevimli mashgʻulotim ovqat tayyorlash.

654
00:37:09,454 --> 00:37:12,254
Ovqat pishirishmi? Ajoyib!

655
00:37:12,277 --> 00:37:14,765
Har kuni pishirasizmi?

656
00:37:14,789 --> 00:37:16,189
Ha.

657
00:37:16,212 --> 00:37:20,480
Men ovqat pishirishni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

658
00:37:20,503 --> 00:37:23,508
Qanday taomlarni koʻp pishirasiz?

659
00:37:23,531 --> 00:37:26,777
Koʻpincha yapon taomlarini pishiraman.

660
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:29,488
Menikoga (goʻshtli kartoshka)ni yaxshi pishiraman.

661
00:37:29,512 --> 00:37:32,245
Vov, menikogami?

662
00:37:32,268 --> 00:37:34,285
Sinab koʻrmoqchiman.

663
00:37:34,309 --> 00:37:38,475
Navbatdagi safar uyimda ziyofat qilmaymizmi?

664
00:37:38,498 --> 00:37:40,349
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

665
00:37:40,373 --> 00:37:42,464
Albatta, kelmoqchiman!

666
00:37:42,488 --> 00:37:45,126
Sevimli mashgʻulotingiz nima?

667
00:37:45,149 --> 00:37:49,116
Men qoʻshiq aytishni yaxshi koʻraman.

668
00:37:49,139 --> 00:37:52,106
Qoʻshiqmi? Yaxshi ekan!

669
00:37:52,129 --> 00:37:54,462
Qayerda qoʻshiq aytasiz?

670
00:37:54,485 --> 00:37:57,652
Koʻpincha karaokega borib qoʻshiq aytaman.

671
00:37:57,674 --> 00:38:00,679
Mark aytgan edi-ku.

672
00:38:00,703 --> 00:38:03,937
Mark nima degan edi?

673
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:07,960
Sizning qoʻshiq aytishingiz juda yaxshi ekan.

674
00:38:07,982 --> 00:38:11,749
Ha? Mark shunday dedimi?

675
00:38:11,773 --> 00:38:13,707
Uyalaman-ku.

676
00:38:13,730 --> 00:38:17,096
Keyingi ziyofatda qoʻshiq aytib bering.

677
00:38:17,119 --> 00:38:18,815
Tushunarli.

678
00:38:18,839 --> 00:38:20,973
Biroz aytaman.

679
00:38:20,996 --> 00:38:23,238
Kutib qolaman!

680
00:38:23,262 --> 00:38:26,495
Koʻp ovqatlar tayyorlayman.

681
00:38:26,518 --> 00:38:30,764
Men shirinliklar xarid qilishni yaxshi koʻraman, shuning uchun olib kelaman.

682
00:38:30,788 --> 00:38:32,388
Rahmat.

683
00:38:32,411 --> 00:38:35,218
Shirinliklarni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

684
00:38:35,242 --> 00:38:37,724
Markni ham chaqiramizmi?

685
00:38:37,747 --> 00:38:42,747
Ha. Mark gitara chalishni yaxshi biladi.

686
00:38:42,770 --> 00:38:44,637
Rostdanmi?

687
00:38:44,660 --> 00:38:47,831
Hammamiz musiqa bilan zavqlanamiz.

688
00:38:47,855 --> 00:38:52,221
Ha. Juda gavjum ziyofat boʻladi.

689
00:38:52,244 --> 00:38:55,178
Yakshanba kunini juda kutaman.

690
00:38:55,201 --> 00:38:58,860
Ha, yakshanba kuni kutib qolamiz.

691
00:38:58,883 --> 00:39:00,383
19-Sahna: Issiq kunning doʻkonda dam olish / Issiq kunda doʻkon tanaffusi

692
00:39:00,383 --> 00:39:04,552
Uf, biroz yurib qoydik-ku.

693
00:39:04,575 --> 00:39:07,184
Charchadim.

694
00:39:07,208 --> 00:39:09,341
Ha, rostdan.

695
00:39:09,364 --> 00:39:13,498
Hozir tashqarida juda issiq.

696
00:39:13,521 --> 00:39:16,754
Tomoq qurib qoldi.

697
00:39:16,777 --> 00:39:18,311
Ha.

698
00:39:18,334 --> 00:39:21,701
U yerda doʻkon bor.

699
00:39:21,724 --> 00:39:25,217
Doʻkonda biror narsa xarid qilamizmi?

700
00:39:25,241 --> 00:39:29,274
Men sovuq choy xarid qilmoqchiman.

701
00:39:29,297 --> 00:39:31,130
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

702
00:39:31,153 --> 00:39:34,753
Men gazlangan suv ichmoqchiman.

703
00:39:34,776 --> 00:39:38,710
Biror narsa yeyish uchun xarid qilamizmi?

704
00:39:38,733 --> 00:39:44,466
Hozir qornim toʻlgan, hech narsa kerak emas.

705
00:39:44,489 --> 00:39:46,061
Shundaymi?

706
00:39:46,084 --> 00:39:50,151
Menda biroz ochlik paydo boʻldi.

707
00:39:50,174 --> 00:39:54,189
Unda, biror onigiri (guruchli kulcha) xarid qiling.

708
00:39:54,213 --> 00:39:56,946
Ha, shunday qilaman.

709
00:39:56,969 --> 00:40:00,010
Men lososli onigirini yaxshi koʻraman.

710
00:40:00,033 --> 00:40:03,800
Doʻkonning muzqaymoqlari ham juda mazali.

711
00:40:03,823 --> 00:40:06,637
Muzqaymoqmi?

712
00:40:06,660 --> 00:40:08,794
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

713
00:40:08,817 --> 00:40:13,883
Lekin, hozir hech narsa yemaslik yaxshiroqmi?

714
00:40:13,906 --> 00:40:15,963
Nega?

715
00:40:15,987 --> 00:40:20,405
Kecha ovqatlanish vaqtigacha atigi bir soat qoldi-ku.

716
00:40:20,429 --> 00:40:23,965
A, unutib qoygan ekanman.

717
00:40:23,988 --> 00:40:27,885
Unda, onigiri yemaslikka qaror qildim.

718
00:40:27,908 --> 00:40:31,642
Ha, faqat ichimlik olamiz.

719
00:40:31,665 --> 00:40:33,431
Tushunarli.

720
00:40:33,454 --> 00:40:36,462
Sovuq ichimlik sotib olaylik.

721
00:40:36,486 --> 00:40:39,720
Pulni men toʻlayman.

722
00:40:39,743 --> 00:40:42,543
Rostdan ham yaxshimi?

723
00:40:42,566 --> 00:40:43,932
Kechirasiz

724
00:40:43,955 --> 00:40:49,591
Har doim yordam berib turasan-ku, bu mayda narsa.

725
00:40:49,614 --> 00:40:51,548
Rahmat.

726
00:40:51,571 --> 00:40:54,704
Unda, choy iltimos qilaman.

727
00:40:54,727 --> 00:40:58,961
Xop, doʻkonga kiramiz.

728
00:40:58,985 --> 00:41:02,830
Doʻkon ichi juda salqin ekan-ku.

729
00:41:02,853 --> 00:41:05,292
Rostdan ham.

730
00:41:05,315 --> 00:41:07,849
Chiqib ketishni istamayman.

731
00:41:07,873 --> 00:41:11,040
Savat qayerda?

732
00:41:11,063 --> 00:41:14,396
Kirish joyi yaqinida.

733
00:41:14,419 --> 00:41:16,186
Tushunarli.

734
00:41:16,209 --> 00:41:18,142
Olib kelaman.

735
00:41:18,165 --> 00:41:19,665
20-SAHNA: Sayohat xotiralari

736
00:41:19,665 --> 00:41:23,520
Oʻtgan haftadagi sayohating qanday boʻldi?

737
00:41:23,543 --> 00:41:28,758
Oʻtgan haftadagi sayohatim juda qiziqarli boʻldi.

738
00:41:28,782 --> 00:41:31,315
Qayerga bording?

739
00:41:31,338 --> 00:41:34,378
Xokkaydoga bordim.

740
00:41:34,401 --> 00:41:36,635
Birinchi marta bordim.

741
00:41:36,658 --> 00:41:40,265
Vay, Xokkaydo ekan-ku.

742
00:41:40,288 --> 00:41:42,466
Sovuq emasmi edi?

743
00:41:42,490 --> 00:41:47,144
Uncha sovuq emas edi, yaxshi boʻldi.

744
00:41:47,167 --> 00:41:49,900
Har kuni ob-havo yaxshi edi.

745
00:41:49,923 --> 00:41:52,656
Yaxshi boʻlgan-ku.

746
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:55,134
Nima yeding?

747
00:41:55,157 --> 00:41:59,003
Koʻp sushi yedim.

748
00:41:59,027 --> 00:42:01,227
Juda mazali edi.

749
00:42:01,250 --> 00:42:06,283
Boʻlardi, men ham sushi yeyishni xohlayman.

750
00:42:06,306 --> 00:42:11,573
Baliq juda yangi edi, shuning uchun hid ham yoʻq edi.

751
00:42:11,597 --> 00:42:14,130
Ramen ham yedingmi?

752
00:42:14,153 --> 00:42:15,920
Ha.

753
00:42:15,943 --> 00:42:19,425
Kechqurun miso ramen yedim.

754
00:42:19,448 --> 00:42:21,300
Issiq boʻldi.

755
00:42:21,323 --> 00:42:24,732
Sayohat xarajatlari qimmatmi boʻldi?

756
00:42:24,755 --> 00:42:29,957
Samolyot biroz qimmat boʻldi, lekin mehmonxona arzon edi.

757
00:42:29,981 --> 00:42:33,215
Mehmonxona chiroyli edi?

758
00:42:33,239 --> 00:42:34,617
Ha.

759
00:42:34,640 --> 00:42:39,007
Yangi va juda chiroyli mehmonxona edi.

760
00:42:39,030 --> 00:42:42,196
Qayerdadir sayyohlik joylariga bordingmi?

761
00:42:42,219 --> 00:42:45,953
Katta koʻlni koʻrishga bordim.

762
00:42:45,975 --> 00:42:48,811
Tinch va chiroyli edi.

763
00:42:48,835 --> 00:42:51,568
Koʻp suratga oldingmi?

764
00:42:51,591 --> 00:42:55,724
Smartfonim bilan 100 ta atrofida suratga oldim.

765
00:42:55,747 --> 00:42:57,714
Keyinroq koʻrsataman.

766
00:42:57,737 --> 00:42:59,304
Rahmat.

767
00:42:59,327 --> 00:43:02,369
Sovgʻa-salom sotib oldingmi?

768
00:43:02,393 --> 00:43:06,126
Mazali pechenye sotib oldim.

769
00:43:06,149 --> 00:43:08,765
Bu sen uchun sovgʻa.

770
00:43:08,789 --> 00:43:11,643
Vay, raxmat!

771
00:43:11,666 --> 00:43:14,033
Juda xursand boʻldim!

772
00:43:14,056 --> 00:43:20,235
Sayohat juda qiziqarli boʻldi, lekin yoʻl uzoq boʻlgani uchun charchadim.

773
00:43:20,258 --> 00:43:23,534
Samolyotda necha soat ketdi?

774
00:43:23,557 --> 00:43:27,575
Tokiodan taxminan 2 soat ketdi.

775
00:43:27,599 --> 00:43:31,011
2 soat bir oz uzoqroq, shunday emasmi?

776
00:43:31,034 --> 00:43:34,434
Lekin yaxshi xotiralar boʻlib qoldi, shunday emasmi?

777
00:43:34,457 --> 00:43:36,352
Ha.

778
00:43:36,376 --> 00:43:40,778
Haqiqatan ham yaxshi boʻldi, yana borishni xohlayman.

779
00:43:40,801 --> 00:43:44,286
Keyingi safar men ham siz bilan birga borishni xohlayman.

780
00:43:44,310 --> 00:43:45,946
Yaxshi ekan.

781
00:43:45,970 --> 00:43:49,770
Qishki Xokkaydo ham juda chiroyli ekanligini aytgansiz.

782
00:43:49,793 --> 00:43:53,526
Unda keyingi safar qishda boring.

783
00:43:53,549 --> 00:43:55,049
21-SAHNA: Yangi oʻqituvchining taqdimoti

784
00:43:55,049 --> 00:44:00,703
U yerda kitob oʻqiyotgan odam kim?

785
00:44:00,726 --> 00:44:05,304
A, derazaga yaqin turgan odammi?

786
00:44:05,328 --> 00:44:10,895
Ha, qora shlyapa kiygan odam.

787
00:44:10,918 --> 00:44:16,285
U oʻtgan haftadan beri kelayotgan yangi oʻqituvchi.

788
00:44:16,308 --> 00:44:18,341
Shundaymi?

789
00:44:18,364 --> 00:44:21,810
Ismi nima deb ataladi?

790
00:44:21,834 --> 00:44:25,067
Tanaka-sensey deb ataladi.

791
00:44:25,090 --> 00:44:30,773
Tanaka-sensey? Nima dars beradi?

792
00:44:30,797 --> 00:44:35,205
Yapon tarixi darsini beradi.

793
00:44:35,228 --> 00:44:38,897
Vay, tarix oʻqituvchisi ekan.

794
00:44:38,920 --> 00:44:41,054
Yosh koʻrinadi.

795
00:44:41,077 --> 00:44:48,810
Ha, kecha oʻqituvchi bilan gaplashganlar hammasi mehribon ekanligini aytishdi.

796
00:44:48,833 --> 00:44:51,306
Bu yaxshi yangilik.

797
00:44:51,329 --> 00:44:54,342
Men ham gaplashib koʻrmoqchiman.

798
00:44:54,366 --> 00:44:59,808
Hozir oʻqituvchi oʻqiyotgan kitob nima haqida?

799
00:44:59,832 --> 00:45:03,065
Juda katta kitob ekan.

800
00:45:03,088 --> 00:45:05,421
Lugʻatmi?

801
00:45:05,444 --> 00:45:11,616
Yoʻq, u yerda koʻp eski fotosuratlar bor kitob.

802
00:45:11,640 --> 00:45:15,976
A, oʻqituvchi yonidagi xonaga oʻtmoqda.

803
00:45:16,000 --> 00:45:20,267
U yerda turgan boshqa oʻqituvchi bilan gaplashayotganga oʻxshaydi.

804
00:45:20,290 --> 00:45:24,103
Oʻqituvchi ushlab turgan sumkasi ham chiroyli.

805
00:45:24,126 --> 00:45:29,726
Ha, u Kiotoda sotib olgan sumka ekanligini aytgan edi.

806
00:45:29,749 --> 00:45:33,525
Kioto? Yaxshi ekan.

807
00:45:33,548 --> 00:45:36,236
Men ham borib koʻrmoqchiman.

808
00:45:36,260 --> 00:45:41,627
Oʻqituvchi Kioto shahridagi universitetda oʻqigan ekan.

809
00:45:41,650 --> 00:45:44,816
Shuning uchun Kioto juda yoqadi.

810
00:45:44,839 --> 00:45:46,909
Tushunarli.

811
00:45:46,933 --> 00:45:51,466
A, oʻqituvchi bu tomonga qarab kuldi.

812
00:45:51,489 --> 00:45:54,023
Ha, rostmi?

813
00:45:54,046 --> 00:45:56,779
Biroz uyatchanlik boʻldi.

814
00:45:56,802 --> 00:45:59,335
Hech qisi yo‘q.

815
00:45:59,358 --> 00:46:01,558
Salomlashish uchun boramiz.

816
00:46:01,581 --> 00:46:06,048
Hozir boshqa odam bilan gaplashayotgani uchun boʻlmaydi.

817
00:46:06,071 --> 00:46:07,804
Ha, rostdan.

818
00:46:07,827 --> 00:46:11,639
Gap tugagunicha shu yerda kutaylik.

819
00:46:11,663 --> 00:46:16,863
Xop. A, u yerda pirog yeyayotgan odam kim?

820
00:46:16,886 --> 00:46:20,552
U Mark ekan.

821
00:46:20,575 --> 00:46:23,109
Har doim yeyapti, shunday emasmi?

822
00:46:23,132 --> 00:46:28,465
Haha, Mark ovqatni juda yaxshi koʻradi.

823
00:46:28,488 --> 00:46:33,288
Ha, Mark pishirgan taomlar ham juda mazali.

824
00:46:33,311 --> 00:46:37,956
Navbatda Mark pishirgan taomni tatib koʻrmoqchiman.

825
00:46:37,979 --> 00:46:42,312
Unda, keyingi safar hammamiz birga ziyofat qilaylik.

826
00:46:42,335 --> 00:46:43,835
22-Sahnа: Hisobot topshirish muddatigacha boʻlgan muammolar / Muammo Hisobotning Oxirgi Muddatidan Oldin

827
00:46:43,835 --> 00:46:48,724
Markazjon, bu hisobotni allaqachon topshirdingizmi?

828
00:46:48,748 --> 00:46:53,435
Yoʻq, bu hisobotni hali yozib boʻlmaganman.

829
00:46:53,458 --> 00:46:55,991
Eee, rostdanmi?

830
00:46:56,014 --> 00:46:58,912
Ertaga ertalabgacha emasmi?

831
00:46:58,936 --> 00:47:03,936
Ha, bilaman, lekin hali tugatolmadim.

832
00:47:03,959 --> 00:47:05,935
Nega?

833
00:47:05,958 --> 00:47:09,002
Vaqt yetarli edi-ku?

834
00:47:09,026 --> 00:47:13,761
Kompyuterim buzilib, ma’lumotlar oʻchib ketdi.

835
00:47:13,784 --> 00:47:16,793
Bu qiyin boʻldi-ku.

836
00:47:16,816 --> 00:47:19,149
Hozir hammasi joyidami?

837
00:47:19,172 --> 00:47:25,187
Ha, doʻstimning kompyuterini olib, hozir yozyapman.

838
00:47:25,211 --> 00:47:27,611
Qancha yozdingiz?

839
00:47:27,634 --> 00:47:29,867
Yarimidaymi?

840
00:47:29,890 --> 00:47:34,457
Yoʻq, hali ozgina yozganman.

841
00:47:34,480 --> 00:47:36,680
Tashvishlanyapman.

842
00:47:36,703 --> 00:47:41,103
Bugun kechgacha ishlashim kerak boʻladi-ku.

843
00:47:41,126 --> 00:47:44,926
Ha, bugun uxlashni rejalashtirmay, yozaman.

844
00:47:44,949 --> 00:47:47,515
Sogʻligingiz joyidami?

845
00:47:47,538 --> 00:47:50,338
Zoʻr bermang, iltimos.

846
00:47:50,361 --> 00:47:52,561
Rahmat.

847
00:47:52,584 --> 00:47:56,624
Lekin topshirmasam, gʻazablanadilar-ku.

848
00:47:56,648 --> 00:48:00,421
Kanji tekshiruvini allaqachon kimdandir soʻradingizmi?

849
00:48:00,445 --> 00:48:04,845
Yoʻq, hali hech kimdan soʻramadim.

850
00:48:04,868 --> 00:48:08,736
Unda, men yordam beraymi?

851
00:48:08,759 --> 00:48:11,359
Ha, rostmi?

852
00:48:11,382 --> 00:48:13,749
Juda katta yordam boʻlardi.

853
00:48:13,772 --> 00:48:17,744
Tugatgan joylaringizni menga koʻrsatib boring.

854
00:48:17,768 --> 00:48:19,737
Tushunarli.

855
00:48:19,760 --> 00:48:23,832
Lekin hali bir sahifani ham tugatolmadim.

856
00:48:23,855 --> 00:48:26,388
Shoshiling.

857
00:48:26,411 --> 00:48:29,296
Vaqt tez oʻtib ketmoqda-ku.

858
00:48:29,320 --> 00:48:33,939
Ha, hozir tezda yozishni boshlayman.

859
00:48:33,963 --> 00:48:37,234
Kechki ovqatni allaqachon yedingizmi?

860
00:48:37,257 --> 00:48:41,424
Yoʻq, hali hech narsa yemadim.

861
00:48:41,446 --> 00:48:43,784
Qorni ochdi.

862
00:48:43,807 --> 00:48:48,974
Unda, men konbini (doʻkonga) borib biror narsa olib kelay.

863
00:48:48,997 --> 00:48:50,397
Kechirasiz

864
00:48:50,421 --> 00:48:53,388
Ikkita onigiri (guruchli toʻp) iltimos.

865
00:48:53,411 --> 00:48:55,491
Tushunarli.

866
00:48:55,514 --> 00:48:57,985
Choy ham olib kelaman.

867
00:48:58,009 --> 00:48:59,648
Rahmat.

868
00:48:59,671 --> 00:49:02,684
Pulni keyinroq beraman.

869
00:49:02,708 --> 00:49:04,641
Boʻlmasin.

870
00:49:04,664 --> 00:49:07,513
Avvalo hisobot ustida ishlashingiz kerak.

871
00:49:07,536 --> 00:49:09,349
Ha.

872
00:49:09,373 --> 00:49:14,551
Menga shunday mehribon ustozim borligi uchun baxtliman.

873
00:49:14,574 --> 00:49:16,449
Ha, ha.

874
00:49:16,473 --> 00:49:19,906
Maqtovlar kerak emas, qoʻllaringizni harakatga keltiring.

875
00:49:19,929 --> 00:49:21,938
Tushunarli.

876
00:49:21,962 --> 00:49:24,695
Diqqatni jamlab, ishlayman.

877
00:49:24,718 --> 00:49:26,218
23-Sahnа: Menyudan tanlash suhbati / Menyudan Tanlash: Suhbat

878
00:49:26,218 --> 00:49:29,418
Menyuda juda koʻp narsalar bor-ku.

879
00:49:29,441 --> 00:49:31,508
Qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

880
00:49:31,530 --> 00:49:33,697
Rostdan ham.

881
00:49:33,720 --> 00:49:39,153
Men goʻsht va baliqdan qaysi birini tanlashda ikkilanyapman.

882
00:49:39,177 --> 00:49:44,510
Siz odatda goʻsht va baliqdan qaysi birini koʻproq yaxshi koʻrasiz?

883
00:49:44,533 --> 00:49:48,791
Men goʻshtni baliqqa qaraganda koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

884
00:49:48,815 --> 00:49:52,582
Unda, bu mol goʻshti qovurigʻi qanday?

885
00:49:52,605 --> 00:49:54,872
Juda mazali koʻrinadi.

886
00:49:54,895 --> 00:49:57,262
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

887
00:49:57,285 --> 00:50:00,618
Bu baliqli taom qanday?

888
00:50:00,641 --> 00:50:06,374
Baliq tana uchun foydali boʻlgani uchun juda mashhur.

889
00:50:06,397 --> 00:50:08,997
Siz qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

890
00:50:09,020 --> 00:50:10,894
Allaqachon qaror qildingizmi?

891
00:50:10,918 --> 00:50:15,051
Men bu tovuq goʻshtli karini tanlayman.

892
00:50:15,074 --> 00:50:18,074
Achchiq taomlarni yaxshi koʻraman.

893
00:50:18,097 --> 00:50:20,503
Kari ham yaxshi ekan.

894
00:50:20,527 --> 00:50:23,410
Hidi shu yergacha kelib turibdi.

895
00:50:23,434 --> 00:50:27,567
Udon bilan soba orasida qaysi birini yaxshi koʻrasiz?

896
00:50:27,590 --> 00:50:31,323
Men sobani koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

897
00:50:31,346 --> 00:50:34,080
Sovuq sobani juda yaxshi koʻraman.

898
00:50:34,103 --> 00:50:38,070
Bu doʻkonda soba ham juda mashhur ekan.

899
00:50:38,093 --> 00:50:40,528
Mazali ekanligini aytishgan edi.

900
00:50:40,552 --> 00:50:43,490
Ha, shundaymi?

901
00:50:43,513 --> 00:50:46,925
Endi yanada ikkilanib qoldim.

902
00:50:46,948 --> 00:50:49,882
Oʻylab koʻring, shoshilmang.

903
00:50:49,905 --> 00:50:52,381
Vaqtimiz bor-ku.

904
00:50:52,405 --> 00:50:58,005
Bu doʻkonning sharbatlari orasida olma va apelsin qaysi biri yaxshiroq?

905
00:50:58,028 --> 00:51:02,761
Men olma sharbatini shirinligi uchun yaxshi koʻraman.

906
00:51:02,784 --> 00:51:06,751
Unda men apelsin sharbatini tanlayman.

907
00:51:06,774 --> 00:51:09,340
Men nordon narsalarni yaxshi koʻraman.

908
00:51:09,363 --> 00:51:14,232
Bizning ta’mga boʻlgan munosabatimiz anchagina farq qiladi ekan-ku.

909
00:51:14,255 --> 00:51:16,111
Qiziqarli.

910
00:51:16,135 --> 00:51:21,511
Ha, shuning uchun ham birga ovqatlanish juda qiziqarli boʻladi.

911
00:51:21,535 --> 00:51:23,168
Ha, rostdan.

912
00:51:23,191 --> 00:51:27,391
A, kechirasiz, buyurtma berishni iltimos qilamiz.

913
00:51:27,414 --> 00:51:31,547
A, men hali tanlamadim-ku.

914
00:51:31,570 --> 00:51:34,337
A, uzr.

915
00:51:34,360 --> 00:51:38,160
Tezroq tanlamasangiz, ofitsiant kelib qoladi-ku.

916
00:51:38,183 --> 00:51:42,659
Unda men birinchi taklif etilgan mol goʻshtli donburini tanlayman.

917
00:51:42,682 --> 00:51:45,572
Qorni och ekan.

918
00:51:45,596 --> 00:51:48,267
Goʻshtga qaror qildingiz-ku.

919
00:51:48,290 --> 00:51:49,979
Yaxshi boʻldi.

920
00:51:50,003 --> 00:51:54,970
Ha, baribir koʻp goʻsht yeyishni xohlayman.

921
00:51:54,993 --> 00:52:00,033
Taomga miso shoʻrva ham qoʻshiladi, shuning uchun juda yaxshi.

922
00:52:00,056 --> 00:52:05,941
Ha, iliq shoʻrva tana uchun juda foydali boʻladi-ku.

923
00:52:05,964 --> 00:52:09,964
Taom kelguncha ertangi rejalari haqida gaplashamizmi?

924
00:52:09,987 --> 00:52:14,405
Ha, ertaga soat nechada joʻnaymiz?

925
00:52:14,429 --> 00:52:15,929
24-SAHNA: Bir yil xotiralari

926
00:52:15,929 --> 00:52:20,362
Tez orada bu sinf ham tugaydi-ku.

927
00:52:20,386 --> 00:52:22,152
Afsuski, juda ham gʻamgin.

928
00:52:22,175 --> 00:52:24,192
Rostdan ham.

929
00:52:24,216 --> 00:52:29,016
Bir yil juda tez oʻtib ketdi deb oʻylayman.

930
00:52:29,039 --> 00:52:34,872
Bu bir yil ichida qaysi fasl siz uchun eng qiziqarli boʻldi?

931
00:52:34,895 --> 00:52:41,128
Menga kuz eng qiziqarli va goʻzal boʻldi deb oʻylayman.

932
00:52:41,151 --> 00:52:43,085
Kuzmi?

933
00:52:43,108 --> 00:52:46,766
Nega kuzni eng yaxshi koʻrasiz?

934
00:52:46,789 --> 00:52:51,646
Chunki hammamiz togʻga borib, kuzgi ranglarni koʻrdik.

935
00:52:51,670 --> 00:52:55,121
A, oʻsha sayohatmi?

936
00:52:55,144 --> 00:52:58,115
Rasm koʻp.

937
00:52:58,139 --> 00:53:04,577
Ha, oʻsha kun ob-havo juda yaxshi edi, sovuq ham boʻlmadi.

938
00:53:04,600 --> 00:53:09,233
Siz uchun qaysi tadbir eng yaxshi xotira boʻlib qoldi?

939
00:53:09,257 --> 00:53:14,624
Menga qishki nutq tanlovi eng koʻp asabiylantirdi.

940
00:53:14,647 --> 00:53:20,454
A, oʻsha paytda har kuni koʻp mashq qilardik-ku.

941
00:53:20,477 --> 00:53:27,717
Ha, sinfda men eng uzun gapni oʻqidim.

942
00:53:27,740 --> 00:53:32,274
Mukofot ololmadim, lekin juda yaxshi chiqdi.

943
00:53:32,297 --> 00:53:33,988
Rahmat.

944
00:53:34,012 --> 00:53:36,845
Yaxshi xotira boʻlib qoldi.

945
00:53:36,868 --> 00:53:42,201
Oʻrganilgan fanlar ichida eng qaysi biri qiyin boʻldi?

946
00:53:42,224 --> 00:53:47,358
Meni oʻylashimcha, hurmat soʻzlarini oʻrganish eng qiyin boʻldi.

947
00:53:47,381 --> 00:53:53,320
Hurmat soʻzlari yaponlar ham xato qiladi, qiyin boʻladi-ku.

948
00:53:53,343 --> 00:54:00,029
Lekin, Tanaka oʻqituvchining dars berish usuli eng tushunarli edi.

949
00:54:00,053 --> 00:54:01,453
Ha, rostdan.

950
00:54:01,476 --> 00:54:06,010
Tanaka oʻqituvchi har doim mehribon edi.

951
00:54:06,033 --> 00:54:11,366
Sinfdagi doʻstlaringiz ichida kim bilan eng koʻp gaplashdingiz?

952
00:54:11,389 --> 00:54:16,189
Men Mark bilan eng koʻp gaplashdim.

953
00:54:16,212 --> 00:54:21,378
Mark har doim jonli va qiziqarli odam, shunday emasmi?

954
00:54:21,401 --> 00:54:27,070
Ha, Mark sinfni yorqinroq qiladi edi.

955
00:54:27,094 --> 00:54:32,431
Keyingi hafta sinf partiyasi qayerda boʻladi?

956
00:54:32,455 --> 00:54:37,929
Maktab yaqinidagi restoran eng arzon va keng.

957
00:54:37,953 --> 00:54:43,153
Unda, hamma bilan oxirgi xotiralarni yarating.

958
00:54:43,176 --> 00:54:44,754
Ha.

959
00:54:44,777 --> 00:54:48,144
Kamerani unutmang, olib boring.

960
00:54:48,167 --> 00:54:52,767
Men koʻp shirinliklar tayyorlab boraman.

961
00:54:52,790 --> 00:54:55,604
Vaa, shu kunni intiroman.

962
00:54:55,627 --> 00:54:59,278
Sizning taomingiz eng mazali boʻladi-ku.

963
00:54:59,302 --> 00:55:02,435
Qattiq harakat qilib tayyorlayman.

964
00:55:02,458 --> 00:55:04,269
Kutib turing.

965
00:55:04,293 --> 00:55:05,793
25-sahna: Kelajak yoʻli va orzular – Savdo sohasidagi ish

966
00:55:05,793 --> 00:55:10,759
Bitirgandan keyin yoʻlingizni aniqladingizmi?

967
00:55:10,782 --> 00:55:12,221
Ha.

968
00:55:12,245 --> 00:55:17,214
Men Yaponiyada ishlashni davom ettirishni rejalashtiryapman.

969
00:55:17,237 --> 00:55:19,680
Yapon kompaniyasida, shundaymi?

970
00:55:19,704 --> 00:55:22,116
Ajoyib!

971
00:55:22,139 --> 00:55:25,073
Qanday ish qilasiz?

972
00:55:25,096 --> 00:55:31,392
Hozirgacha oʻrganganimni ishlatib, savdo sohasida ishlashni niyat qilaman.

973
00:55:31,415 --> 00:55:34,458
Savdo sohasidagi ishmi?

974
00:55:34,481 --> 00:55:37,648
Ingliz tilidan ham koʻp foydalanasizmi?

975
00:55:37,671 --> 00:55:39,271
Ha.

976
00:55:39,294 --> 00:55:43,627
Bu ingliz va yapon tillarini ikkalasini ham ishlatadigan ish.

977
00:55:43,650 --> 00:55:49,450
Shuning uchun har kuni kechgacha maktabda oʻqir edingiz-ku.

978
00:55:49,473 --> 00:55:51,331
Ha.

979
00:55:51,354 --> 00:55:56,554
Yapon tilimni yanada yaxshilab, faolroq boʻlishni xohlayman.

980
00:55:56,577 --> 00:55:59,581
Kelajakdagi orzingiz nima?

981
00:55:59,605 --> 00:56:02,412
Qanday inson boʻlishni xohlaysiz?

982
00:56:02,435 --> 00:56:09,635
Men kelajakda bu mamlakatda uzoq vaqt davomida koʻp tajriba orttirishni xohlayman.

983
00:56:09,658 --> 00:56:14,791
Siz albatta yaxshi jamiyat aʼzosi boʻlasiz.

984
00:56:14,814 --> 00:56:16,654
Rahmat.

985
00:56:16,678 --> 00:56:21,334
Bu mening birinchi ishim, shuning uchun hoziridan intiqlik bilan kutaman.

986
00:56:21,357 --> 00:56:25,723
Kelajakda ham hozirgi shaharda yashashni rejalashtiryapsizmi?

987
00:56:25,746 --> 00:56:30,992
Yoʻq, kelasi yildan Osakada yashashni rejalashtiryapman.

988
00:56:31,016 --> 00:56:33,782
Chunki narxlar arzon.

989
00:56:33,805 --> 00:56:39,138
Osaka taomlari juda mazali ekanligini aytgansiz-ku.

990
00:56:39,161 --> 00:56:43,642
Ha, koʻp takoyaki yeyishni rejalashtiryapman.

991
00:56:43,666 --> 00:56:45,800
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

992
00:56:45,823 --> 00:56:50,105
Maosh koʻtarilsa, meni chaqirib qoʻying.

993
00:56:50,128 --> 00:56:53,261
Ehehe, albatta.

994
00:56:53,284 --> 00:56:55,884
Koʻp mehmon qilishni rejalashtiryapman.

995
00:56:55,907 --> 00:56:58,198
Vaʼda qildingiz-ku.

996
00:56:58,221 --> 00:57:02,155
Men qimmat goʻsht yeyishni xohlayman.

997
00:57:02,178 --> 00:57:06,911
Koʻp ishlab, boy boʻlishga harakat qilaman.

998
00:57:06,934 --> 00:57:13,218
Yangi ish boshlashdan oldin, biror maxsus tayyorgarlik koʻrasizmi?

999
00:57:13,242 --> 00:57:18,135
Bu qish oʻzim uchun kimono sotib olishni rejalashtiryapman.

1000
00:57:18,159 --> 00:57:21,027
Kimono, shundaymi?

1001
00:57:21,050 --> 00:57:23,858
Oʻzingiz kiyolaversizmi?

1002
00:57:23,882 --> 00:57:27,500
Yoʻq, hali yoʻq.

1003
00:57:27,524 --> 00:57:32,057
Shuning uchun YouTube’dan oʻrganmoqchiman.

1004
00:57:32,080 --> 00:57:37,255
Oʻzingiz kimono kiya olsangiz, juda zoʻr boʻlardi, shundaymi?

1005
00:57:37,278 --> 00:57:43,478
Ha, Yaponiyaning Yangi yili kuni kimononi kiyib, ziyoratgohga borishni xohlayman.

1006
00:57:43,502 --> 00:57:47,158
Orzuingiz tobora kattalashib boryapti, koʻrinadi!

1007
00:57:47,182 --> 00:57:49,115
Sizni qoʻllab-quvvatlayman!

1008
00:57:49,138 --> 00:57:50,671
Rahmat.

1009
00:57:50,694 --> 00:57:55,177
Sizning keyingi rejalarizni ham keyinroq aytib bering.

1010
00:57:55,201 --> 00:57:56,701
26-SAHNA: Dam olish kunlari sayohat rejasi

1011
00:57:56,701 --> 00:57:59,634
Tez orada dam olish kunlari boshlanadi-ku!

1012
00:57:59,657 --> 00:58:03,490
Dam olish kunlari uchun sayohat rejangizni allaqachon tuzdingizmi?

1013
00:58:03,513 --> 00:58:05,047
Ha.

1014
00:58:05,070 --> 00:58:08,346
Doʻstlarim bilan qayergadir boramiz.

1015
00:58:08,369 --> 00:58:10,536
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

1016
00:58:10,559 --> 00:58:13,726
Uzoqroq joylar bormi?

1017
00:58:13,749 --> 00:58:17,549
Yoʻq, u qadar uzoq emas.

1018
00:58:17,572 --> 00:58:19,461
Shundaymi?

1019
00:58:19,484 --> 00:58:22,084
Nima bilan borasizlar?

1020
00:58:22,107 --> 00:58:24,540
Shinkansen (tez poyezd) bilanmi?

1021
00:58:24,563 --> 00:58:28,251
Yoʻq, shinkansen emas.

1022
00:58:28,275 --> 00:58:30,909
Mashinada boramiz.

1023
00:58:30,932 --> 00:58:33,298
Mashinami?

1024
00:58:33,321 --> 00:58:36,291
Kim haydaydi?

1025
00:58:36,315 --> 00:58:38,884
Doʻstim haydaydi.

1026
00:58:38,908 --> 00:58:42,558
Men haydashni bilmayman-ku.

1027
00:58:42,581 --> 00:58:44,514
Shundaymi?

1028
00:58:44,537 --> 00:58:47,829
Mashhur sayyohlik joylaridan birimimi?

1029
00:58:47,853 --> 00:58:49,469
Ha.

1030
00:58:49,492 --> 00:58:53,226
Issiq buloqlar bor shaharchaga boramiz.

1031
00:58:53,249 --> 00:58:55,620
Issiq buloqlarmi?

1032
00:58:55,643 --> 00:58:58,110
Ajoyib boʻlardi!

1033
00:58:58,133 --> 00:59:00,025
Ha.

1034
00:59:00,048 --> 00:59:04,581
Issiq buloqda choʻmilib, dam olamiz.

1035
00:59:04,604 --> 00:59:07,606
Mehmonxonani allaqachon band qildingizmi?

1036
00:59:07,630 --> 00:59:09,363
Ha.

1037
00:59:09,386 --> 00:59:13,725
Togʻlar orasidagi eski mehmonxonani band qildim.

1038
00:59:13,749 --> 00:59:16,353
Togʻlar orasimi?

1039
00:59:16,377 --> 00:59:19,421
Manzara chiroyli boʻlsa kerak, shundaymi?

1040
00:59:19,445 --> 00:59:21,096
Ha.

1041
00:59:21,120 --> 00:59:26,453
Lekin dam olish kunlari yoʻllar gavjum boʻladi, deb oʻylayman.

1042
00:59:26,476 --> 00:59:28,515
Ha, rostdan.

1043
00:59:28,538 --> 00:59:32,176
Erta chiqib ketish yaxshiroq boʻlardi.

1044
00:59:32,200 --> 00:59:33,800
Ha.

1045
00:59:33,823 --> 00:59:37,356
Ertalab soat beshda chiqmoqchimiz.

1046
00:59:37,379 --> 00:59:39,512
Beshmi?

1047
00:59:39,535 --> 00:59:41,935
Juda erta ekan-ku!

1048
00:59:41,958 --> 00:59:43,525
Ha.

1049
00:59:43,548 --> 00:59:46,922
Yoʻlda qayergadir toʻxtaysizmi?

1050
00:59:46,946 --> 00:59:51,601
Mazali taomlar bor servis markazida toʻxtamoqchimiz.

1051
00:59:51,624 --> 00:59:53,224
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

1052
00:59:53,247 --> 00:59:56,658
Ehtiyot haydab boring!

1053
00:59:56,681 --> 00:59:57,938
Ha.

1054
00:59:57,961 --> 01:00:00,179
Rahmat.

1055
01:00:00,203 --> 01:00:01,703
27-SAHNA: Yaponiyadagi sayohat joylari

1056
01:00:01,703 --> 01:00:06,870
Mark-san, Yaponiyada qayerga borishni xohlaysiz?

1057
01:00:06,893 --> 01:00:11,508
Men Fudzi togʻiga borishni xohlayman.

1058
01:00:11,532 --> 01:00:13,609
Fudzi togʻimi?

1059
01:00:13,632 --> 01:00:16,066
Chiqmoqchimisiz?

1060
01:00:16,089 --> 01:00:17,822
Koʻrmoqchimisiz?

1061
01:00:17,845 --> 01:00:21,331
Albatta, choʻqqisiga chiqmoqchiman!

1062
01:00:21,355 --> 01:00:26,488
Fudzi togʻining choʻqqisidan koʻrinadigan manzara juda chiroyli boʻladi.

1063
01:00:26,511 --> 01:00:28,589
Shundaymi?

1064
01:00:28,613 --> 01:00:31,752
Borishni yanada koʻproq xohlab qoldim.

1065
01:00:31,776 --> 01:00:34,709
Boshqa joylar ham bormi?

1066
01:00:34,732 --> 01:00:37,206
Kyotoga ham borishni xohlardim.

1067
01:00:37,230 --> 01:00:39,196
Kyoto, deysizmi?

1068
01:00:39,219 --> 01:00:42,862
Kyotoda nima qilishni xohlaysiz?

1069
01:00:42,886 --> 01:00:47,452
Koʻp eski ibodatxonalar va ziyoratgohlarni koʻrishni xohlardim.

1070
01:00:47,475 --> 01:00:49,075
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

1071
01:00:49,098 --> 01:00:53,114
Kimono kiyib sayr qilish ham juda qiziqarli.

1072
01:00:53,138 --> 01:00:56,405
Vaa, men ham buni sinab koʻrmoqchiman!

1073
01:00:56,428 --> 01:00:59,515
Mazali yapon shirinliklarini ham tatib koʻrishni xohlardim.

1074
01:00:59,539 --> 01:01:04,154
Ha, juda mazali sushi ham koʻp yeymoqchiman.

1075
01:01:04,178 --> 01:01:06,311
Sushi, deysizmi?

1076
01:01:06,334 --> 01:01:08,267
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

1077
01:01:08,290 --> 01:01:12,747
Yapon baliqlari juda yangi boʻladi-ku.

1078
01:01:12,771 --> 01:01:16,137
Xokkaydoning baliqlari ham juda mazali.

1079
01:01:16,160 --> 01:01:18,527
Xokkaydo, deysizmi?

1080
01:01:18,550 --> 01:01:21,685
U yerga ham borib koʻrishni xohlardim.

1081
01:01:21,708 --> 01:01:24,908
Borishni xohlaydigan joylaringiz koʻp ekan.

1082
01:01:24,931 --> 01:01:29,698
Ha, koʻp pul va vaqt kerak boʻladi-ku.

1083
01:01:29,721 --> 01:01:32,054
Haha, shunday, rostdan ham.

1084
01:01:32,077 --> 01:01:35,851
Avval Fudzi togʻidan boshlaymiz.

1085
01:01:35,875 --> 01:01:40,491
Ha, bu yozda albatta borishni xohlayman.

1086
01:01:40,515 --> 01:01:43,848
Reja tuzish ham juda qiziqarli boʻladi-ku.

1087
01:01:43,871 --> 01:01:48,438
Ha, hozirdayoq juda xursand boʻlyapman!

1088
01:01:48,461 --> 01:01:49,961
28-sahna: Dam olish kunlarini oʻtkazish / Dam olish kunlarini qanday oʻtkazasiz

1089
01:01:49,961 --> 01:01:56,394
Mark, dam olish kunlarini qanday oʻtkazasiz?

1090
01:01:56,417 --> 01:02:01,984
Men uyda film koʻraman yoki doʻstlarim bilan xarid qilaman.

1091
01:02:02,007 --> 01:02:03,859
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

1092
01:02:03,882 --> 01:02:07,415
Qanday filmlarni koʻproq koʻrasiz?

1093
01:02:07,438 --> 01:02:11,416
Aksion filmlar va animeni koʻproq koʻraman.

1094
01:02:11,440 --> 01:02:13,007
Shundaymi?

1095
01:02:13,030 --> 01:02:16,406
Xarid qilish uchun qayerga borasiz?

1096
01:02:16,429 --> 01:02:20,429
Shibuya va Shinjukudagi univermaglarga boraman.

1097
01:02:20,452 --> 01:02:23,230
Juda gavjum joylar ekan-ku.

1098
01:02:23,253 --> 01:02:25,787
Nima xarid qilasiz?

1099
01:02:25,810 --> 01:02:29,346
Kiyim va poyabzallarni koʻproq xarid qilaman.

1100
01:02:29,369 --> 01:02:31,169
Juda zamonaviy ekan-ku.

1101
01:02:31,192 --> 01:02:34,959
Yakshanba kunlari nima qilasiz?

1102
01:02:34,982 --> 01:02:41,467
Yakshanba kunlari bogʻda sayr qilaman yoki kafe da kitob oʻqiyman.

1103
01:02:41,490 --> 01:02:44,338
Tinch dam olish kunlari ekan.

1104
01:02:44,362 --> 01:02:46,035
Ha.

1105
01:02:46,059 --> 01:02:50,859
Ovqat pishiraman, xonani tozalayman ham.

1106
01:02:50,882 --> 01:02:53,049
Ajoyibsiz!

1107
01:02:53,071 --> 01:02:58,950
Men dam olish kunlarida kir yuvaman yoki uxlardim.

1108
01:02:58,974 --> 01:03:02,623
Koʻp uxlash sogʻliq uchun yaxshi boʻladi-ku.

1109
01:03:02,647 --> 01:03:04,180
Ha.

1110
01:03:04,203 --> 01:03:08,570
Lekin baʼzan biror joyga chiqib ketishni xohlardim.

1111
01:03:08,593 --> 01:03:14,263
Unda, navbatdagi dam olish kunimizda birga muzeyni borib koʻrmaymizmi?

1112
01:03:14,287 --> 01:03:16,454
Muzey, deysizmi?

1113
01:03:16,477 --> 01:03:18,477
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

1114
01:03:18,500 --> 01:03:22,533
Rasm koʻramiz, choy ichamiz.

1115
01:03:22,556 --> 01:03:23,923
Ha.

1116
01:03:23,946 --> 01:03:26,612
Albatta birga borishni xohlayman!

1117
01:03:26,635 --> 01:03:28,648
Juda kutaman!

1118
01:03:28,672 --> 01:03:31,438
Shanba kuni boramiz.

1119
01:03:31,461 --> 01:03:33,261
Tushunarli.

1120
01:03:33,284 --> 01:03:36,651
Shanba kuni ertalab uchrashamiz.

1121
01:03:36,674 --> 01:03:38,174
29-sahna: Tanishuv va Yaponiyada tajribalar / Birinchi uchrashuv va Yaponiyadagi tajribalar

1122
01:03:38,174 --> 01:03:43,907
Salom, bu oydan boshlab bu sinfga qoʻshilgan talabasizmi?

1123
01:03:43,930 --> 01:03:46,897
Ha, salom.

1124
01:03:46,920 --> 01:03:48,597
Meni ismim Smit.

1125
01:03:48,620 --> 01:03:53,426
Smit, Yaponiyada hayot siz uchun yangi mi?

1126
01:03:53,449 --> 01:03:57,288
Yoʻq, yangi emas.

1127
01:03:57,312 --> 01:03:59,712
Shundaymi?

1128
01:03:59,735 --> 01:04:03,624
Yaponiyaga oldin kelganmisiz?

1129
01:04:03,647 --> 01:04:08,485
Ha, ikki yil oldin bir marta kelganman.

1130
01:04:08,508 --> 01:04:11,541
Oʻshanda sayohat qilganmisiz?

1131
01:04:11,564 --> 01:04:17,564
Ha, sayohat chogʻida Kiotoga va Osakaga bordim.

1132
01:04:17,587 --> 01:04:19,061
Shundaymi?

1133
01:04:19,085 --> 01:04:23,219
Yapon taomlaridan biron birini tatib koʻrgansizmi?

1134
01:04:23,242 --> 01:04:28,484
Ha, sushi va tenpurani tatib koʻrdim.

1135
01:04:28,507 --> 01:04:31,107
Nattoni qanday, tatib koʻrdingizmi?

1136
01:04:31,131 --> 01:04:35,009
Nattoni hali tatib koʻrmadim.

1137
01:04:35,032 --> 01:04:39,437
Bir oz hidli, lekin juda mazali.

1138
01:04:39,460 --> 01:04:41,279
Shundaymi?

1139
01:04:41,303 --> 01:04:43,936
Navbatda tatib koʻraman.

1140
01:04:43,959 --> 01:04:47,326
Fujiyama (Fujisan)ga chiqdingizmi?

1141
01:04:47,349 --> 01:04:54,282
Yoʻq, uzoqdan koʻrganman, lekin chiqmaganman.

1142
01:04:54,305 --> 01:04:57,913
Bu yozda albatta chiqib koʻring.

1143
01:04:57,937 --> 01:05:01,190
Ha, chiqmoqchiman.

1144
01:05:01,213 --> 01:05:06,179
Smit-san, yapon tilini qayerda oʻrgandingiz?

1145
01:05:06,202 --> 01:05:10,336
Amerikadagi universitetda biroz oʻrgandim.

1146
01:05:10,359 --> 01:05:14,796
Yapon doʻstlaringiz bilan gaplashganmisiz?

1147
01:05:14,819 --> 01:05:17,861
Yoʻq, hali yoʻq.

1148
01:05:17,885 --> 01:05:22,738
Bu maktabda koʻp yaponlar bor, ularga gapirib koʻring.

1149
01:05:22,762 --> 01:05:26,295
Ha, koʻp gaplashmoqchiman.

1150
01:05:26,318 --> 01:05:27,818
30-Sahna: Kechikish uchun uzrlar / Kechikib kelganlik uchun bahonalar

1151
01:05:27,818 --> 01:05:31,951
Mark-san, nega kechikdingiz?

1152
01:05:31,974 --> 01:05:36,552
Men bu yerda bir soatdan koʻproq kutdim-ku!

1153
01:05:36,576 --> 01:05:39,048
Rostdan uzr, kechikib qoldim.

1154
01:05:39,071 --> 01:05:42,238
Uyqum kelib qoldi.

1155
01:05:42,261 --> 01:05:43,716
Ha?

1156
01:05:43,740 --> 01:05:45,615
Uyqu kelib qoldimi?

1157
01:05:45,638 --> 01:05:49,518
Kecha kechgacha uygʻoq boʻldingizmi?

1158
01:05:49,542 --> 01:05:51,219
Ha.

1159
01:05:51,243 --> 01:05:55,009
Kecha koʻp aroq ichib qoʻydim.

1160
01:05:55,032 --> 01:05:58,566
Boshim juda ogʻriyapti.

1161
01:05:58,589 --> 01:06:02,355
Koʻp ichish yaxshi emas-ku.

1162
01:06:02,378 --> 01:06:07,145
Bugun muhim yigʻilish bor, kechikib boʻlmaydi.

1163
01:06:07,168 --> 01:06:10,014
Ha, tushundim.

1164
01:06:10,037 --> 01:06:15,004
Shoshilib kelganim uchun nafasim qisilib ketdi.

1165
01:06:15,027 --> 01:06:17,469
Yugurib kelgansizmi?

1166
01:06:17,493 --> 01:06:22,926
Endi bundan keyinroq erta uxlashingiz kerak.

1167
01:06:22,949 --> 01:06:26,882
Ha, bundan keyinroq eʼtibor beraman.

1168
01:06:26,905 --> 01:06:30,872
Koʻp terlagansiz-ku.

1169
01:06:30,895 --> 01:06:34,187
Suv ichganingiz maʼqul.

1170
01:06:34,211 --> 01:06:35,811
Rahmat.

1171
01:06:35,834 --> 01:06:40,167
U yerda doʻkon bor, borib olib kelaman.

1172
01:06:40,190 --> 01:06:44,724
Yigʻilish tez boshlanadi, shoshiling.

1173
01:06:44,747 --> 01:06:48,113
Ha, tez qaytaman.

1174
01:06:48,136 --> 01:06:51,670
Sogʻligingiz chinakam yaxshimi?

1175
01:06:51,693 --> 01:06:55,859
Biroz uyqusirab qoldim, lekin yaxshi.

1176
01:06:55,882 --> 01:07:00,849
Ish tugagach, tezroq uyga borib uxlasangiz yaxshi boʻlardi.

1177
01:07:00,872 --> 01:07:06,605
Ha, bugun albatta erta uxlayman.

1178
01:07:06,628 --> 01:07:09,286
Keling, boramiz.

1179
01:07:09,309 --> 01:07:13,729
Ha, chin chin uzr.